<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohane Asɛmpa No</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Asɛmpa No</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Hann A Ɛwɔ Sum Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Ansa na wɔrebɛbɔ ewiase no, na Asɛm no wɔ hɔ dada. Na Asɛm no ne Onyankopɔn na ɛwɔ hɔ. Na Asɛm no yɛ Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Ahyɛaseɛ no, na Asɛm no ne Onyankopɔn na ɛwɔ hɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Ɛnam ne so na wɔbɔɔ adeɛ nyinaa. Wɔankwati no anyɛ biribiara. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Ne mu na nkwa wɔ; na saa nkwa no na ɛma nnipa hann. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Hann no hyerɛn wɔ esum mu a esum no ntumi nni hann no so.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Onyankopɔn somaa ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Yohane. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Ɔbɛdii hann no ho adanseɛ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛma nnipa afa ne so agye hann no adi. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Ɛnyɛ ɔno ankasa ne hann no, na mmom, ɔbaa sɛ ɔrebɛdi hann no ho adanseɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Saa hann yi ne nokorɛ hann a ɛba ewiase ma ɛhyerɛn nnipa nyinaa so no. <verse eid="JHN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na Asɛm no wɔ ewiase. Ɛwom sɛ Onyankopɔn nam ne so na ɔbɔɔ ewiase deɛ, nanso ɔbaa ewiase no, ewiase anhunu no. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Ɔbaa nʼankasa ne ɔman mu, nanso ne manfoɔ annye no anto mu. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Na wɔn a wɔgyee no, na wɔgyee ne din diiɛ no, ɔmaa wɔn tumi ma wɔbɛyɛɛ Onyankopɔn mma <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>wɔ honhom fam, a ɛmfiri onipa anaa ɔhonam fam, na mmom ɛfiri Onyankopɔn ankasa.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Asɛm no bɛyɛɛ onipa ne yɛn bɛtenaeɛ ma yɛhunuu nʼanimuonyam sɛ ɔba korɔ a ɔfiri Agya no nkyɛn a adom ne nokorɛ ahyɛ no ma.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yohane kaa ne ho asɛm sɛ, “Yei ne deɛ mekaa ne ho asɛm sɛ, ‘Deɛ ɔdi mʼakyi reba no yɛ kɛse sene me, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔwɔ hɔ ansa na wɔwoo me no.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Ɔfiri ne mmɔborɔhunu a ɛtoɔ ntwa da no mu hyira yɛn nyinaa daa daa. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Onyankopɔn nam Mose so de mmara maa yɛn, nanso ɛnam Yesu so na yɛnyaa adom ne nokorɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Obiara nhunuu Onyankopɔn da, gye ne Ba korɔ no a ɔno nso yɛ Onyankopɔn no, deɛ ɔwɔ Agya no nkyɛn na wada no adi no.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Adansedie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Yudafoɔ mpanin a wɔwɔ Yerusalem somaa asɔfoɔ ne Lewifoɔ kɔɔ Yohane nkyɛn kɔbisaa no sɛ, “Wone Agyenkwa no anaa?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Yohane antwentwɛn asɛm no mmuaeɛ so. Ɔpaee mu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn prɛko pɛ sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ mene Agyenkwa no.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ɛnneɛ, na wone hwan, Elia anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, “Dabi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wɔbisaa no bio sɛ, “Wone Odiyifoɔ no?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Ɔsane buaa wɔn sɛ, “Dabi”.<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Wɔsane bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛnneɛ, na wone hwan? Ka kyerɛ yɛn na yɛnkɔbɔ wɔn a wɔsomaa yɛn no amaneɛ. Asɛm bɛn na wowɔ ka fa wo ho?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yohane buaa wɔn sɛ, “Mene nne a ɛfiri ɛserɛ so a ɛreteam, sɛdeɛ Odiyifoɔ Yesaia hyɛɛ nkɔm sɛ, ‘Monsiesie mo ho mma Awurade ba a ɔbɛba no no.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Afei, wɔn a Farisifoɔ no somaa wɔn no bisaa Yohane bio sɛ, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>“Sɛ ɛnyɛ wone Agyenkwa no anaa Elia anaa Odiyifoɔ no a, adɛn enti na wobɔ asu?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yohane nso buaa sɛ, “Me deɛ, nsuo na mede bɔ asu, nanso obi wɔ mo mfimfini ha a monnim no, <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>a ne mpaboa mpo memfata sɛ meworɔ; ɔno na ɔbɛdi mʼakyi aba.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Saa asɛm yi sii Betania a ɛwɔ Asubɔnten Yordan agya, faako a na Yohane rebɔ asu no.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Onyankopɔn Dwammaa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ a Yohane hunuu Yesu sɛ ɔreba ne nkyɛn no, ɔteaam kaa sɛ, “hwɛ, Onyankopɔn Dwammaa a ɔyi ewiase bɔne korɔ no! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Yei ne deɛ mekaa ne ho asɛm sɛ, ‘Deɛ ɔdi mʼakyi reba no yɛ kɛse sene me, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔwɔ hɔ ansa na mereba.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Me deɛ, na mennim no, nanso mede nsuo bɛbɔɔ asu, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ na mɛda no adi akyerɛ Israel.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Na Yohane dii adanseɛ sɛ, “Mehunuu Honhom no sɛ asiane aba ne so sɛ aborɔnoma a ɔresiane firi soro. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Na anka mennim no, nanso ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn somaa me sɛ memfa nsuo mmɔ asu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, ‘Onipa a wobɛhunu sɛ Honhom no bɛsiane aba ne so no, ɔno ne deɛ worehwɛ nʼanim no. Ɔno na ɔde Honhom Kronkron bɛbɔ asu.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Mahunu yeinom nyinaa sɛ aba mu na medi ho adanseɛ sɛ yei ne Onyankopɔn Ba no.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asuafoɔ A Wɔdi Kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ a Yohane ne nʼasuafoɔ no mu baanu gyina baabi no, wɔhunuu sɛ Yesu retwam. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Yohane hwɛɛ no, kaa sɛ, “Yei ne Onyankopɔn Dwammaa no!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Asuafoɔ baanu no tee deɛ ɔkaeɛ no, wɔkɔdii Yesu akyi. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesu twaa nʼani hunu sɛ wɔdi nʼakyi no, ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na morehwehwɛ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Wɔn nso bisaa no sɛ, “Rabi” (a ne nkyerɛaseɛ ne Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ), “ɛhe na wote?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mommra mmɛhwɛ.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Enti, wɔne no kɔ kɔhwɛɛ faako a ɔte no ne no tenaa hɔ firi awia nnɔnnan kɔsii anwummerɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Nnipa baanu a wɔtee Yohane asɛm no enti ɛmaa wɔkɔdii Yesu akyi no mu baako ne Simon Petro nua Andrea. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Adeɛ a ɛdi ɛkan a Andrea yɛeɛ ne sɛ, ɔkɔhwehwɛɛ ne nua Petro ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yɛahunu Mesia no.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Ɔde Petro kɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu hwɛɛ Petro dinn ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wone Simon, Yohane ba no. Nanso, ɛfiri ɛnnɛ rekɔ wɔbɛfrɛ wo Kefa.”</char> Ɛno ara ne Petro a nʼasekyerɛ ne Ɔbotan no.<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Frɛ Filipo Ne Natanael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Yesu yɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔbɛkɔ Galilea. Ɔhunuu Filipo ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Di mʼakyi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filipo nso na ɔfiri Betsaida a ɛhɔ na Petro ne Andrea nso firi. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filipo firi hɔ kɔɔ Natanael nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yɛahunu Agyenkwa no a Mose ne adiyifoɔ no hyɛɛ ne ho nkɔm no no. Wɔfrɛ no Yesu. Ɔyɛ Yosef a ɔfiri Nasaret no ba.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natanael bisaa Filipo sɛ, “Ade pa bi bɛtumi afiri Nasaret aba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipo nso ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Bra na bɛhwɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu hunuu Natanael sɛ ɔreba no, ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Israelni nokwafoɔ ni ampa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natanael bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Woyɛɛ dɛn hunuu sɛdeɛ meteɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu nso buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛberɛ a wowɔ borɔdɔma dua no ase hɔ no na mehunuu wo ansa na Filipo rebɛfrɛ wo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Natanael kaa sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, wone Onyankopɔn Ba, Israelhene no!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Esiane sɛ meka kyerɛɛ wo sɛ mehunuu wo wɔ borɔdɔma dua no ase enti na wogye di anaa? Wobɛhunu nneɛma akɛseɛ a ɛsene yeinom.</char> <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/><char style="wj">Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ, mobɛhunu sɛ ɔsoro abue na Onyankopɔn abɔfoɔ redi aforosiane Onipa Ba no soɔ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ma Nsuo Dane Nsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Ne nnansa so, nnipa bi hyiaa ayeforɔ wɔ Kana a ɛwɔ Galilea asase so. Yesu maame kɔɔ saa ayeforɔhyia no bi. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Wɔtoo nsa frɛɛ Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no nso kɔɔ hɔ bi. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Wɔgu so regye wɔn ani no, ayeforɔ no ase nsã saeɛ maa Yesu maame kɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wɔn nsã a wɔrenom no asa.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ ne maame sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na wopɛsɛ me yɛ, me berɛ nnya nnuruiɛ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Ne maame ka kyerɛɛ asomfoɔ no sɛ, “Biribiara a ɔbɛka sɛ monyɛ no, monyɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Na aboɔ nsuhina nsia sisi hɔ; yeinom mu na na Yudafoɔ de nsuo gu de hohoro wɔn ho amanneɛ kwan so. Na suhina biara tumi fa nsuo galɔn aduasa.<verse eid="JHN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ asomfoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momfa nsuo nhyehyɛ nhina no ma ma.”</char> Wɔde nsuo hyɛɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="JHN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monsa bi nkɔma onipa a ayeforɔ no ho ntotoeɛ hyɛ ne nsa no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Deɛ ayeforɔ no ho ntotoeɛ hyɛ ne nsa no kaa nsuo no a adane nsã no hwɛeɛ. Na ɔnnim baabi a na nsã no firi, nanso na asomfoɔ no deɛ, wɔnim. Ɔfrɛɛ ayeforɔkunu no <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Saa nsã yi yɛ nsã pa. Wonte sɛ afoforɔ a wɔaka no. Obiara a ɔto ɛpono de nsã pa di ɛkan ba wɔ nʼapontoɔ ase, na akyire yi, ɔde nsã a ɛnni mu aba. Nanso, wo deɛ, wode nsã pa no atwa toɔ!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Saa nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a Yesu yɛɛ wɔ Kana a ɛwɔ Galilea asase so no ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛdi ɛkan a ɔyɛɛ wɔ badwam de kyerɛɛ sɛ ne tumi firi ɔsoro. Ɛmaa nʼasuafoɔ no nso gyee no dii sɛ, ampa ara, ɔno ne Agyenkwa no.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Ayeforɔhyia no akyi, ɔne ne maame ne ne nuanom ne nʼasuafoɔ no dii nna kakra wɔ Kapernaum.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Asɔredan Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Esiane sɛ na Yudafoɔ Twam Afahyɛ no rebɛduru no enti, Yesu kɔɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Ɔduruu asɔredan no mu hɔ no, ɔhunuu sɛ adwadifoɔ bi nso tete wɔn apono akyi resesa sika. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Yesu faa ntampehoma, yɛɛ no mpire, de pamoo sikasesafoɔ no ne wɔn nnwan ne wɔn anantwie no firii asɔredan mu hɔ, kaa wɔn apono guiɛ maa wɔn sika a wɔresesa no nyinaa bɔ pansamee. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Afei, ɔkɔɔ wɔn a wɔtɔn mmorɔnoma no so ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monsesa wɔn mfiri ha nkɔ ntɛm! Mommfa mʼAgya fie nyɛ adwadibea!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Asuafoɔ no kaa sɛ, wɔatwerɛ wɔ Atwerɛsɛm no mu sɛ, “Wo fie yiedie ho dadwene ahyɛ me so.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Afei, Yudafoɔ mpanin no bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Tumi bɛn na wowɔ a enti wopamoo nnipa no? Yɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi fa di adanseɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn na ɔmaa wo saa tumi no.”<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mate deɛ moaka no. Nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a mede bɛdi adanseɛ ara ne sɛ, mommubu asɔredan yi ngu na mede nnansa bɛsi bio.”</char><verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Yudafoɔ mpanin no tee asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no, wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Asɔredan a wɔde mfeɛ aduanan nsia siiɛ no, na wode nnansa bɛtumi asi?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Nanso, Yesu deɛ, na ɔde ɔno ankasa ne onipadua na ɛreyɛ asɔredan no mfatoho, <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Yesu wusɔreɛ no akyi ansa na asuafoɔ no kaee asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no. Yei ma wɔgyee Atwerɛsɛm ne nsɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no diiɛ.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Ɛberɛ a Twam Afahyɛ no duruiɛ a na Yesu wɔ Yerusalem no, nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ahodoɔ bebree maa nnipa gyee no diiɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Nanso, Yesu amfa ne ho anto wɔn so, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔnim sɛdeɛ nnipa suban te. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Na ɔnhia onipa adanseɛ a ɔbɛdi afa onipa ho, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔnim deɛ ɛwɔ onipa mu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Nikodemo Kɔ Yesu Nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Anadwo bi, ɔbarima bi a ɔyɛ Yudafoɔ mpanin no mu baako a wɔfrɛ no Nikodemo a ɔsane yɛ Farisini no, <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>kɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn, kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, yɛnim sɛ Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa wo, ɛfiri sɛ, obiara ntumi nyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a woyɛ yi gye sɛ Onyankopɔn ka ne ho.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merema woate aseɛ sɛ, sɛ wɔanwo wo foforɔ a, worentumi nkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikodemo bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na me abasiriwa yi, bɛtumi akɔ me maame yam ama wɔawo me bio?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesu nso buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ wo, sɛ wɔamfiri nsuo ne Honhom mu anwo obi a, ɔrentumi nkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/><char style="wj">Deɛ wɔfiri onipa mu awo no no, yɛ ɔhonam, na deɛ wɔfiri Honhom mu awo no no, yɛ honhom.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/><char style="wj">Mma ɛnnyɛ wo nwanwa sɛ maka sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔwo wo foforɔ!</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/><char style="wj">Sɛdeɛ wote mframa nka, nanso wontumi nkyerɛ faako a ɛfiri ba ne faako a ɛbɔ kɔ no, saa ara na Honhom mu awoɔ no nso te.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikodemo bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na yei aba mu?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo, ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ a wodi mu Israel na wonte yei ase?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/><char style="wj">Deɛ yɛnim ne deɛ yɛahunu na yɛreka akyerɛ mo yi, nanso monnye yɛn nni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/><char style="wj">Sɛ meka asase yi so nsɛm kyerɛ mo na monnye nni a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na sɛ meka ɔsoro nsɛm kyerɛ mo a, mobɛgye adi?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/><char style="wj">Obiara nkɔɔ ɔsoro da, agye deɛ ɔfiri ɔsoro baeɛ no—Onipa Ba no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/><char style="wj">Sɛdeɛ Mose maa ɔwɔ sɛso a wɔde kɔbere ayɛ asɛn dua so wɔ ɛserɛ so no, saa ara na Onipa Ba no nso wɔbɛma no so,</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/><char style="wj">na obiara a ɔgye me di no, ɔbɛnya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>“Na sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn dɔɔ ewiase nie; sɛ ɔde ne Ba a ɔwoo no korɔ no maeɛ, na obiara a ɔgye no di no anyera, na mmom wanya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Onyankopɔn ansoma ne Ba amma ewiase sɛ ɔmmɛbu ewiase atɛn, na mmom, ɔsomaa no sɛ, ɔmmɛgye ewiase nkwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Obiara a ɔgye ɔba no di no, wɔremmu no atɛn; na deɛ ɔnnye no nni no, wɔabu no atɛn dada, ɛfiri sɛ, wannye Onyankopɔn Ba korɔ no anni. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Deɛ Onyankopɔn gyina so bu atɛn ne sɛ: Hann no aba ewiase, nanso nnipa ani gye sum ho sene Hann no, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn nneyɛeɛ nyinaa yɛ bɔne. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ biara mpɛ Hann no, na ɔremmɛn Hann no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔsuro sɛ ne nneyɛeɛ bɔne no bɛda adi. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Na deɛ ɔyɛ Onyame apɛdeɛ no ba Hann no mu na obiara ahunu sɛ ɔyɛ Onyame apɛdeɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Di Yesu Ho Adanseɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Yei akyi, Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no firii Yerusalem kɔɔ Yudea akuraa bi ase kɔtenaa hɔ kakra bɔɔ asu wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara na Yohane nso rebɔ asu wɔ Ainon a ɛbɛn Salim, ɛfiri sɛ, na nsuwansuwa wɔ hɔ. Nnipa pii baa ne nkyɛn ma ɔbɔɔ wɔn asu. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na wɔmfaa Yohane ntoo afiase. <verse eid="JHN 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Ɛda bi, Yohane akyidifoɔ bi ne Yudani bi gyee akyinnyeɛ faa ahodwira ho. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Enti, asuafoɔ no kɔɔ Yohane nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, ɔbarima bi a na ɔwɔ wo nkyɛn wɔ Yordan fa nohoa no a wodii ne ho adanseɛ no nso rebɔ asu na nnipa pii rekɔ ne nkyɛn.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yohane buaa sɛ, “Obi rentumi nni dwuma a ɛte saa gye sɛ Onyame ka ne ho. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Mo ara modi me adanseɛ sɛ meka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, ‘Ɛnyɛ me ne Kristo no, na mmom, wɔasoma me adi nʼanim kane.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Adamfo a ɔboa ayeforɔkunu no wɛn nʼaso twɛn no, na sɛ ɔte ne nne a, nʼani gye. Ɛno enti na mʼanigyeɛ wie pɛyɛ no. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ɔkɛseɛ na me nso meyɛ ɔketewa.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>“Deɛ ɔfiri ɔsoro aba no yɛ ɔkɛseɛ sene obiara; Deɛ ɔfiri asase so no yɛ wiaseni na ɔkasa sɛ wiaseni. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Ɔsoroni no ka deɛ wahunu ne deɛ wate, nanso obiara nnye no nni. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Wɔn a wɔgye no di no di adanseɛ sɛ, Onyankopɔn yɛ ɔnokwafoɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Deɛ Onyankopɔn asoma no no ka Onyankopɔn asɛm, ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn de ne Honhom ahyɛ no ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Agya no dɔ ne Ba no enti ɔde biribiara so tumi ahyɛ ne nsa. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Deɛ ɔgye Ɔba no di no bɛnya nkwa a ɛnsa da, na deɛ ɔnnye no nni no rennya nkwa a ɛnsa da, na mmom, Onyankopɔn asotwe da ne so.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbaa A Na Ɔwɔ Kununom Baanum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Farisifoɔ no tee sɛ nnipa pii rekɔ Yesu nkyɛn ama wabɔ wɔn asu sene sɛdeɛ nnipa kɔ Yohane nkyɛn. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Nso na Yesu ankasa deɛ, ɔmmɔ asu, na mmom, nʼasuafoɔ no na wɔbɔ asu. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Yesu tee saa asɛm yi no, ɔfirii Yudea sane kɔɔ Galilea.<verse eid="JHN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Ɔrekɔ no, na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔfa Samaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Ɛbɛyɛ owigyinaeɛ no, na Yesu abɛn Samaria kuro bi a wɔfrɛ no Sikar a ɛbɛn asase bi a Yakob de maa ne ba Yosef no ho. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Ɛhɔ na na Yakob abura wɔ. Esiane ɔbrɛ a na Yesu abrɛ enti, ɔtenaa abura no ho sɛ ɔregye nʼahome. Na saa ɛberɛ no bɛyɛ awia nnɔndumienu.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Ankyɛre, Samariani baa bi baa hɔ bɛtoo nsuo, na Yesu srɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ma me nsuo no bi nnom.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na Yesu asuafoɔ no kɔ kuro no mu kɔtɔ aduane.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Samariani baa no ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ɛyɛ me nwanwa sɛ wo a woyɛ Yudani rebisa nsuo afiri me a meyɛ Samariani nkyɛn.” Na Yudafoɔ ne Samariafoɔ nni hwee yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ wonim akyɛdeɛ a Onyankopɔn de ma onipa anaa onipa ko a ɔresrɛ wo nsuo yi a, anka wobɛsrɛ no, na wama wo nkwa nsuo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Ɔbaa no bisaa sɛ, “Owura, wonni ahoma, nni bokiti, abura yi mu nso dɔ yie, na ɛhe na wobɛnya saa nkwa nsuo no afiri? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Woyɛ ɔkɛseɛ sene yɛn agya Yakob a ɔtuu abura yi maa yɛn na ɔne ne mma, ne nnwan ne nʼanantwie nom mu nsuo bi no anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔnom saa nsuo yi bi no, osukɔm de no bio,</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/><char style="wj">nanso deɛ ɔbɛnom nsuo a mede bɛma no no, osukɔm renne no bio da. Nsuo a mede bɛma no no bɛyɛ sɛ asutire a ɛrenwe da wɔ ne mu, na ɛbɛma no nkwa a ɛrensa da.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Ɔbaa no srɛɛ no sɛ, “Owura, ma me saa nkwa nsuo yi bi na osukɔm anne me bio, na daa mantwa kwan ammɛto nsuo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Kɔfrɛ wo kunu na wo ne no mmra.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Ɔbaa no buaa no sɛ, “Me wura, menni kunu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu nso kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Asɛm a woaka no yɛ nokorɛ sɛ wonni kunu no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/><char style="wj">Woaware mmarima baanum agyae na ɔbarima a wo ne no wɔ hɔ seesei no mpo, ɔnyɛ wo kunu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Ɔbaa no kaa sɛ, “Owura, mehunu sɛ woyɛ odiyifoɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Yɛn agyanom Samariafoɔ somm Onyankopɔn wɔ saa bepɔ yi so, nanso mo Yudafoɔ deɛ, moka sɛ Yerusalem nko ara na ɛsɛ sɛ yɛsom Onyankopɔn.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merema woate aseɛ sɛ berɛ bi bɛba a nnipa rensom Agya no wɔ saa bepɔ yi so anaa Yerusalem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/><char style="wj">Mo Samariafoɔ nnim deɛ mosom no. Nanso, yɛn Yudafoɔ deɛ, yɛnim deɛ yɛsom no, ɛfiri sɛ, Yudafoɔ so na nkwagyeɛ nam ba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/><char style="wj">Nna bi reba, na mpo aba dada sɛ, nokorɛ asomfoɔ bɛsɔre Agya no wɔ Honhom ne nokorɛ mu. Yeinom ne asomfoɔ a Agya no hwehwɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/><char style="wj">Onyankopɔn yɛ Honhom, na wɔn a wɔsom no no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsom no Honhom ne nokorɛ mu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Ɔbaa no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Menim sɛ Mesia no a wɔfrɛ no Kristo no bɛba, na sɛ ɔba a, ɔbɛkyerɛkyerɛ yɛn biribiara mu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me a me ne wo rekasa yi, mene Kristo no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Yesu ano siiɛ pɛ na nʼasuafoɔ no sane baeɛ. Ɛyɛɛ asuafoɔ no nwanwa sɛ wɔbɛtoo Yesu sɛ ɔne ɔbaa bi redi nkɔmmɔ. Nanso, wɔn mu biara ammisa ɔbaa no deɛ ɔrehwehwɛ ne Yesu nso deɛ enti a ɔne saa ɔbaa no redi nkɔmmɔ no.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Afei, ɔbaa yi gyaa nʼasuhina no hɔ sane kɔɔ kuro no mu kɔka kyerɛɛ kurom hɔfoɔ sɛ, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Mommra mmɛhwɛ ɔbarima bi a waka kɔkoam nneɛma a mayɛ akyerɛ me! Anaa, ɔno ne Agyenkwa no?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Nnipa a wɔtee asɛm yi nyinaa bɔɔ twi kɔhwɛɛ Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Afei, asuafoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, didi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mewɔ aduane a medi a monnim ho hwee.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Ɛmaa asuafoɔ no bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Obi abrɛ no aduane bi anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mʼaduane ne sɛ meyɛ deɛ ɔsomaa me no apɛdeɛ na mewie dwuma a ɔde maa me sɛ memmɛdi no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/><char style="wj">Moka sɛ, ‘Abosome anan mu, otwaberɛ bɛduru.’ Mommue mo ani nhwɛ mo ho nhyia, na mobɛhunu sɛ aburoo ahoa a ɛkyerɛ sɛ, otwaberɛ aduru!</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/><char style="wj">Otwafoɔ nya nʼakatua a ɛsɛ no na ɔboaboa deɛ watwa no ano ma nkwa a ɛnsa da. Yei ma deɛ ɔdua ne deɛ ɔtwa no nyinaa ani gye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/><char style="wj">Ɛyɛ nokorɛ pefee sɛ, ‘Obi dua na obi twa.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/><char style="wj">Mesomaa mo kɔɔ baabi sɛ monkɔtwa deɛ ɛnyɛ mo na moduaeɛ. Nnipa foforɔ na wɔduaeɛ na mo deɛ, moanya mfasoɔ afiri adwuma a wɔyɛ no mu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samariafoɔ Pii Gye Yesu Di</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Esiane adanseɛ a Samariani baa no dii wɔ Yesu ho sɛ, “Waka biribiara a mayɛ akyerɛ me” no enti, kuro no mu hɔfoɔ pii gyee Yesu dii sɛ ɔno ne Mesaia no. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Enti, ɛberɛ a Samariafoɔ no baa Yesu nkyɛn no, wɔsrɛɛ sɛ ɔntena wɔn nkyɛn. Ɔpenee so dii nnanu wɔ wɔn nkyɛn. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Ne nsɛm no enti nnipa bebree gyee no diiɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Nnipa a wɔgyee no dii no ka kyerɛɛ ɔbaa no sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ adanseɛ a wobɛdiiɛ no enti na yɛgye no di, na mmom nsɛm a yɛate sɛ ɔka no enti na yɛagye no adi. Na yɛnim sɛ ɔno ne ewiase Agyenkwa no.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galileafoɔ Gye Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Nnanu akyi no, Yesu firii kuro no mu kɔɔ Galilea. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Ɛwom sɛ na Yesu aka sɛ, odiyifoɔ biara nni animuonyam wɔ ne ɔman mu deɛ, nanso <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>ɛsiane deɛ Galileafoɔ a wɔwɔ Yerusalem Twam Afahyɛ berɛ no mu no hunuu deɛ Yesu yɛeɛ no enti, ɔduruu Galilea no, wɔgyee no.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Abɔfra Bi Yadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Ɔsane kɔɔ Kana a ɛwɔ Galilea, faako a ɔmaa nsuo danee nsã hɔ no bio. Ɔwɔ hɔ no, ɔhene ɔsomfoɔ panin bi a na ne ba yare wɔ Kapernaum no <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>tee Yesu nka sɛ ɔfiri Yudea aba Galilea hɔ. Saa ɔbarima yi kɔɔ Kana kɔhunuu Yesu, srɛɛ no sɛ, ɔne no nkɔ Kapernaum nkɔsa ne ba a na ɔyare a ɔreyɛ awu no yadeɛ mma no.<verse eid="JHN 4:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Menyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ nkyerɛ mo ansa na moagye me adi anaa?”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Ɔsomfoɔ panin no de ahoyera ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Owura, mesrɛ wo, ma yɛnkɔ ntɛm, anyɛ saa a, me ba no bɛwu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Kɔ efie, wo ba no ho ayɛ no den!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Ɔsomfoɔ panin no gyee asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no dii na ɔsiim sɛ ɔrekɔ efie. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Ɔnam ɛkwan so no, nʼasomfoɔ bi bɛhyiaa no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ne ba no ho ayɛ no den. <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Ɔbarima no bisaa nʼasomfoɔ no sɛ, “Ɛberɛ bɛn na ne ho yɛɛ no den?” Asomfoɔ no buaa no sɛ, “Nnora awia bɛyɛ dɔnko berɛ mu na huraeɛnini a na abɔ no no gyaeeɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 4:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Ɔbarima no tee asɛm no pɛ na ɔkaee sɛ ɛyɛ saa ɛberɛ korɔ no ara mu na Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Kɔ na wo ba no ho ayɛ no den no.”</char> Yei maa ɔbarima no ne ne fiefoɔ nyinaa gyee Yesu diiɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Yei ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛtɔ so mmienu a Yesu firii Yudea baa Galilea no ɔyɛeɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Obubuafoɔ Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Yei akyi no, Yudafoɔ afahyɛ bi enti, Yesu sane kɔɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Na ɔtadeɛ bi wɔ kuro no mu a wɔfrɛ no Betesda a na ɛbɛn kuro no ano ɛpono kɛseɛ bi a wɔfrɛ no Nnwan Ɛpono no. Na wɔabɔ apata ahodoɔ enum atwa ho ahyia. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Saa apata yi ase na na ayarefoɔ pii sɛ, anifirafoɔ, mpakye ne mmubuafoɔ wɔ retwɛn sɛ Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ firi ɔsoro bɛba abɛhono nsuo no. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Deɛ ɛteɛ ne sɛ, sɛ ɔbɔfoɔ no hono nsuo no wie a, ɔyarefoɔ a ɔbɛdi ɛkan atɔ nsuo no mu no nya ayaresa. <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Na ɔbarima bi ayare ada ɔtadeɛ no ho mfeɛ aduasa nwɔtwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yesu hunuu sɛ wayare ada hɔ akyɛre no, ɔbisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wopɛ sɛ wo ho yɛ wo den anaa?”</char><verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Ɔyarefoɔ no buaa no sɛ, “Me wura, sɛ ɔbɔfoɔ no bɛhono nsuo no a, mennya obi a ɔbɛma me so ato mu. Ɛberɛ biara a mɛbɔ me ho mmɔden sɛ merekɔ nsuo no mu no, obi di me ɛkan.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɔre! Bobɔ wo kɛtɛ na kɔ efie.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Amonom hɔ ara, ɔbarima no ho yɛɛ no den; ɔbobɔɔ ne kɛtɛ, hyɛɛ aseɛ nanteeɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Na saa da no yɛ homeda. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Yudafoɔ mpanin hunuu ɔbarima no sɛ ɔso ne kɛtɛ no, wɔn bo fuu yie. Wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Wonnim sɛ ɛnnɛ yɛ homeda na ɛtia mmara sɛ wobɛsoa wo kɛtɛ anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Ɔbarima yi de ahopopoɔ yii ne ho ano sɛ, “Onipa a ɔsaa me yadeɛ no na ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, mensoa me kɛtɛ na menkɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Wɔtee saa no, wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Hwan ne saa onipa yi?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Nso na deɛ ne ho yɛɛ no den no nnim Yesu. Afei, nso na Yesu afiri nnipa no mu kɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Akyire yi, Yesu hyiaa ɔbarima yi wɔ asɔredan mu tuu no fo sɛ, <char style="wj">“Afei a wo ho ayɛ wo den yi, hwɛ yie na woankɔyɛ bɔne bio amma biribi a ɛsene kane yadeɛ no amma wo so.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Ɔbarima yi firii hɔ kɔka kyerɛɛ Yudafoɔ mpanin no sɛ ɛyɛ Yesu na ɔsaa no yadeɛ no.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tumi A Ɔba No Wɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Yudafoɔ mpanin yi hyɛɛ aseɛ tanee Yesu ani, ɛfiri sɛ, wabu wɔn homeda mmara no so. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mʼagya yɛ adwuma ɛberɛ biara, enti ɛsɛ sɛ me nso meyɛ adwuma ɛberɛ biara.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Saa asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ yi maa Yudafoɔ mpanin no bo fuiɛ, na wɔyɛɛ wɔn adwene sɛ wɔbɛkum no, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɛnyɛ homeda mmara no nko na wabu so, na bio, ɔfrɛ ne ho sɛ Onyankopɔn Ba de kyerɛ sɛ, ɔne Onyankopɔn yɛ pɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔba no ntumi mfiri ne pɛ mu nyɛ biribi, na mmom, ɔyɛ deɛ ɔhunu sɛ nʼAgya yɛ no bi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ, Agya no dɔ Ɔba no na biribiara a Agya no yɛ no, ɔma Ɔba no hunu. Na Ɔba no bɛyɛ nnwuma akɛseɛ a ɛsene saa ɔbarima yi ayaresa yi ama mo ho adwiri mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/><char style="wj">Na sɛdeɛ Agya no nyane awufoɔ no, saa ara nso na Ɔba no nyane awufoɔ a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔnyane wɔn no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/><char style="wj">Afei koraa, mʼAgya mmu obiara atɛn. Ɔde saa atemmuo tumi no ahyɛ Ɔba no nsa,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/><char style="wj">sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a obiara bɛdi Ɔba no ni sɛdeɛ wɔdi Agya no ni no. Obiara a ɔnni Ɔba no ni no, nni Agya a ɔsomaa no no nso ni.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ: Obiara a ɔtie me nsɛm na ɔgye deɛ ɔsomaa me no di no, wɔ nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ. Wɔremmu no atɛn, ɛfiri sɛ, wafiri owuo mu aba nkwa mu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/><char style="wj">Mereka nokorɛ bio sɛ, ɛberɛ bi reba, na mpo saa ɛberɛ no anya aba a awufoɔ bɛte Onyankopɔn Ba no nne, na wɔn a wɔte ne nne no bɛnya nkwa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/><char style="wj">Sɛdeɛ Agya no yɛ nkwamafoɔ no, saa ara nso na wama ne Ba no tumi ama wayɛ nkwamafoɔ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/><char style="wj">Wama Ɔba no tumi a ɔde bu atɛn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno ne Onipa Ba no.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mommma saa asɛm yi nnyɛ mo nwanwa, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛberɛ bi reba a awufoɔ a wɔwɔ wɔn damena mu mpo bɛte me nne,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/><char style="wj">na wɔasɔresɔre. Wɔn a wɔayɛ papa no bɛnyane atena nkwa mu, na wɔn a wɔayɛ bɔne no nso, wɔabu wɔn fɔ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/><char style="wj">Merentumi mfiri mʼankasa me tumi mu nyɛ biribiara; asɛm a Onyankopɔn aka akyerɛ me no so na megyina bu atɛn. Ɛno enti, atɛn a mebu no yɛ nokorɛ.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ho Adansedie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ me ara medi me ho adanseɛ a, mʼadansedie no nni mu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/><char style="wj">Na obi wɔ hɔ a ɔdi me ho adanseɛ a menim sɛ nʼadanseɛ a ɔdi fa me ho no yɛ nokorɛ.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Moasoma nnipa akɔ Yohane nkyɛn na wadi adanseɛ a ɛyɛ nokorɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/><char style="wj">Nnipa adansedie ho nhia me ansa na moahunu onipa ko a meyɛ. Na mmom, meka Yohane adanseɛ a ɔdii no kyerɛ mo sɛ deɛ ɛbɛyɛ na Onyankopɔn bɛgye mo nkwa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/><char style="wj">Yohane nsɛm a ɔkaeɛ yɛ kanea a wɔasɔ na ɛhyerɛn, na ɛmaa mo ani gyeeɛ.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>
    <char style="wj">“Me nnwuma a mʼAgya de ama me sɛ menyɛ no di me ho adanseɛ sene Yohane.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/><char style="wj">Ɛwom sɛ monhunuu Agya no anim da, na montee ne nne nso da, nanso wadi me ho adanseɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/><char style="wj">Na nʼasɛm no nso mommfa nsie mo tirim, ɛfiri sɛ, monnnye me a ɔsomaa me no nni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/><char style="wj">Mosua Atwerɛsɛm no ɛfiri sɛ, mogye di sɛ ɛno na ɛbɛma mo anya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ. Nanso, saa Atwerɛsɛm korɔ no ara di me ho adanseɛ!</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/><char style="wj">Yei nyinaa akyi no, mommpɛ sɛ moba me nkyɛn na moanya nkwa!</char><verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>
    <char style="wj">“Merenhwehwɛ nnipa anim animuonyam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/><char style="wj">Menim nnipa ko a moyɛ. Menim sɛ monni Onyankopɔn ho dɔ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/><char style="wj">Mebaa mʼAgya din mu nanso moannye me. Nanso, sɛ obi ba wɔ ɔno ara ne din mu na ɔbɛyɛ deɛ ɔpɛ a, ɛno deɛ, mogye no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/><char style="wj">Mopɛ sɛ nnipa kamfo mo mmom sene sɛ Onyankopɔn bɛkamfo mo. Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na moagye me adi?</char><verse eid="JHN 5:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ me na mɛka asɛm bi atia mo Agya no anim, na mmom, ɛyɛ Mose a mode mo ani too ne mmara so sɛ ɛno na monam so bɛkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie mu no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mogyee Mose diiɛ a, anka me nso mobɛgye me adi, ɛfiri sɛ, nsɛm a ɔtwerɛeɛ no di me ho adanseɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/><char style="wj">Na ɛsiane sɛ moannye nsɛm a ɔtwerɛeɛ no anni no enti, ɛnyɛ nwanwa sɛ monnye me nni.”</char><verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ma Nnipa Mpemnum Aduane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Yei akyi, Yesu twaa Galilea Po a wɔsane frɛ no Tiberia Po no. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Esiane sɛ nkurɔfoɔ hunuu sɛ Yesu nam anwanwakwan so asa nnipa pii yadeɛ no enti, wɔdii nʼakyi. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no kɔɔ bepɔ bi so kɔtenaa hɔ kakra. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Twam Afahyɛ no abɛn.<verse eid="JHN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu twaa nʼani, hunuu sɛ nnipakuo no reba ne nkyɛn no, ɔbisaa Filipo sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛhe na yɛbɛnya aduane ama saa nnipa dodoɔ yi?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Yesu bisaa Filipo saa asɛm yi de sɔɔ no hwɛeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔnim deɛ ɔbɛyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filipo buaa sɛ, “Ansa na yɛbɛtumi ama saa nnipa dodoɔ yi aduane no, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛnya abosome nwɔtwe akatua.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Andrea a ɔyɛ Simon Petro nua no kaa sɛ, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Abarimaa bi wɔ ha a ɔwɔ burodo enum ne nkyenam mmienu; na yei bɛtumi aso nnipa dodoɔ yi di?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesu hyɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momma obiara ntena ase.”</char> Asuafoɔ no ma wɔtenatenaa ɛserɛ no so. Na mmarima a wɔwɔ wɔn mu no dodoɔ bɛyɛ mpemnum. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yesu faa burodo no bɔɔ mpaeɛ na ɔkyɛ maa wɔn. Ɔfaa saa ɛkwan korɔ no ara so kyɛɛ nkyenam no nso maa wɔn.<verse eid="JHN 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Wɔdidi meeɛ akyi no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ <char style="wj">“Mommoaboa aduane a aka no ano na ebi ansɛe.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Wɔboaboaa aduane a ɛkaeɛ no ano no, ɛyɛɛ nkɛntɛmma dumienu.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Nnipa no hunuu nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a Yesu ayɛ no, wɔkaa sɛ, “Ampa ara, onipa yi ne odiyifoɔ a yɛrehwɛ no ɛkwan no.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yesu hunuu sɛ nnipa no ayɛ wɔn adwene sɛ wɔbɛkyere no asi no ɔhene no, ɔtwee ne ho firii wɔn mu kɔɔ bepɔ no so bio.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Nante Po So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Onwunu dwoeɛ no, Yesu asuafoɔ no kɔɔ Galilea mpoano. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Wɔtwɛn kɔsii sɛ adeɛ saeɛ na ɔmma no, wɔkɔtenaa kodoɔ mu sɛ wɔrekɔ Kapernaum. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na ahum retu wɔ ɛpo so ama ɛpo no so ayɛ gyabagyaba. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Wɔhare kɔɔ wɔn anim bɛyɛ akwansini mmiɛnsa anaa ɛnan no, wɔhunuu sɛ obi nam ɛpo no so reba; yei maa ehu kaa wɔn kɔsii sɛ, <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ me, Monnsuro!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Asuafoɔ no pɛɛ sɛ anka wɔde no tena kodoɔ no mu, nanso ntɛmpa ara kodoɔ no kɔduruu Kapernaum.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, nnipa a na wɔwɔ Galilea ɛpo no agya no hunuu sɛ kodoɔ baako pɛ na na ɛwɔ hɔ, nanso asuafoɔ no tenaa mu kɔeɛ a na Yesu nka wɔn ho. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Ankyɛre koraa na akodoɔ foforɔ bi firi Tiberia baa faako a Awurade maa nnipakuo no aduane diiɛ no. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Ɛberɛ a nnipa no hunuu sɛ Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no nni hɔ no, wɔtenatenaa akodoɔ no mu sɛ wɔrekɔ Kapernaum akɔhwehwɛ no.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Nkwa Aduane No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Wɔduruu Kapernaum na wɔhunuu Yesu no, wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, ɛberɛ bɛn na wobaa ha?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ, ɛnyɛ sɛ mohunuu anwanwadeɛ a meyɛeɛ no enti na morehwehwɛ me, na mmom, sɛ monyaa aduane di meeɛ no enti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/><char style="wj">Monnsɛe mo berɛ nyinaa mmpere nhwehwɛ aduane a ɛtumi sɛe no akyiri kwan, na mmom, mompere nhwehwɛ aduane a ɛtena hɔ daa a ɛma nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ a Onipa Ba no de bɛma mo no akyiri kwan. Ɛfiri sɛ, yei enti na mʼAgya somaa me.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Nnipa no bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na yɛnyɛ na yɛasɔ Onyankopɔn ani?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yei ne deɛ Onyankopɔn pɛ sɛ moyɛ, monnye deɛ wasoma no no nni.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Nnipa no bisaa no bio sɛ, “Anwanwadeɛ bɛn na wobɛyɛ akyerɛ yɛn ama yɛagye wo adi? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Sɛ wopɛ sɛ yɛgye wo di sɛ wone Agyenkwa no deɛ a, ɛnneɛ ma yɛn aduane nni daa sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no di ho adanseɛ sɛ, Mose maa yɛn nananom ɔsoro aduane dii wɔ ɛserɛ so no.”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ, ɛnyɛ Mose na ɔmaa mo nananom aduane a ɛfiri ɔsoro no dii ɛserɛ so hɔ no na mmom, ɛyɛ mʼAgya. Na afei deɛ, ɔma mo aduane a ɛfiri ɔsoro a ɛma nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ no di daa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/><char style="wj">Saa aduane a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn nkyɛn no ne onipa a ɔfiri ɔsoro ba asase so na ɔde nkwa brɛ ewiase no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Nnipa no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Owura, ma yɛn saa aduane no bi nni daa.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mene burodo a ɛma nkwa no. Obiara a ɔba me nkyɛn na ɔgye me di no, ɛkɔm anaa osukɔm renne no da.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/><char style="wj">Sɛdeɛ maka akyerɛ mo no, moahunu me nnwuma, nanso monnye me nni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/><char style="wj">Obiara a mʼAgya de no ama me no bɛba me nkyɛn, na obiara a ɔbɛba me nkyɛn nso no, merempam no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/><char style="wj">Na mefiri ɔsoro baa asase so sɛ merebɛyɛ deɛ ɔsomaa me no apɛdeɛ, na ɛnyɛ mʼapɛdeɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ ɔsomaa me no apɛdeɛ ne sɛ, mɛhwɛ wɔn a ɔde wɔn ama me no nyinaa so yie na da a ɛdi akyire no, manyane wɔn ama wɔn nkwa foforɔ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/><char style="wj">MʼAgya apɛdeɛ ne sɛ, obiara a ɔba me nkyɛn na ɔgye me di no bɛnya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ, na da a ɛdi akyire no, manyane no ama no nkwa foforɔ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Yudafoɔ no tee sɛ Yesu aka sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mene aduane a ɛfiri ɔsoro”</char> no, wɔnwiinwiiɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Wɔkɔɔ so kaa sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ Yosef ne Maria ba ne saa Yesu yi? Ɛyɛɛ dɛn na ɔtumi ka sɛ ɔfiri ɔsoro na ɔbaeɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnyae anwiinwii no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/><char style="wj">Mommma ɛnnyɛ mo nwanwa sɛ maka saa, na obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛtumi aba me nkyɛn, gye sɛ Agya no a ɔsomaa me no twe no ba me ho, na da a ɛdi akyire no, mɛnyane no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/><char style="wj">Adiyifoɔ no twerɛɛ sɛ, ‘Onyankopɔn ankasa bɛkyerɛkyerɛ ne mma.’ Ɛno enti, obiara a ɔtie Agya no nkyerɛkyerɛ no ba me nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/><char style="wj">Asɛm a maka yi nkyerɛ sɛ obi ahunu Agya no pɛn, gye onipa a ɔfiri Agya no nkyɛn no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/><char style="wj">Mereka nokwasɛm akyerɛ mo sɛ, obiara a ɔgye me di a ɛma nkwa a ɛfiri no nya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/><char style="wj">Mene burodo a ɛma nkwa no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/><char style="wj">Mo nananom dii mana wɔ ɛserɛ so, nso wɔwuwuiɛ,</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/><char style="wj">nanso burodo a ɛfiri ɔsoro ba no yɛ burodo a obi di a ɔrenwu da.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/><char style="wj">Mene burodo a ɛfiri ɔsoro no; sɛ obi di saa burodo yi a, ɔbɛtena ase daa. Burodo a mede bɛma obiara a ɔba me nkyɛn no, ne me honam a mede ma, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ na ewiase bɛnya nkwa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ yi maa Yudafoɔ no bo fuiɛ ma wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na saa onipa yi atumi de ne honam ama yɛn sɛ aduane ama yɛadi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mereka nokwasɛm akyerɛ mo; moanni Onipa Ba no honam sɛ aduane na moannom ne mogya a, morennya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔdi me honam sɛ aduane na ɔnom me mogya no nya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ, na da a ɛdi akyire no, mɛnyane no ama no nkwa foforɔ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/><char style="wj">Me honam ne aduane pa no, na me mogya nso ne nsu pa no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔdi me honam sɛ aduane na ɔnom me mogya sɛ nsuo no te me mu, na me nso mete ne mu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/><char style="wj">Sɛdeɛ Agya teasefoɔ no somaa me na ɔno enti, mete ase no, saa ara nso na obiara a ɔdi me honam sɛ aduane no, me enti, ɔbɛtena ase.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/><char style="wj">Yei ne burodo a ɛfiri ɔsoro baeɛ. Ɛnte sɛ mana a yɛn nananom dii wɔ ɛserɛ so na wɔwuwuiɛ no. Saa burodo yi deɛ, obiara a ɔbɛdi bi no bɛtena ase daa.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Ɛberɛ a na Yesu rekyerɛkyerɛ wɔ hyiadan mu wɔ Kapernaum no na ɔkaa saa nsɛm yi.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akyidifoɔ No Mu Pii Twe Wɔn Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Yesu akyidifoɔ no mu pii tee asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no, wɔkaa sɛ, “Saa asɛm yi deɛ, ɛkyere yɛn adwene. Hwan na ɔbɛte aseɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yesu hunuu sɛ nʼakyidifoɔ no renwiinwii no, ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Asɛm a mekaeɛ yi to mo suntidua anaa?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/><char style="wj">Ɛnneɛ, ɛba sɛ Onipa Ba no resane akɔ ɔsoro, faako a ɔfiri baeɛ no a, ɛdeɛn na mobɛyɛ?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/><char style="wj">Onyankopɔn honhom na ɛma nkwa. Onipa ntumi mma nkwa. Nsɛm a maka akyerɛ mo yi yɛ honhom na nkwa wɔ mu,</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/><char style="wj">nanso mo mu bi nnye nni.”</char> Ɛfiri ahyɛaseɛ no na Yesu hunuu wɔn a wɔnnye no nni ne wɔn a wɔbɛtwe wɔn ho afiri ne ho. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Ɔkɔɔ so kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yei enti na meka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, obi ntumi mma me nkyɛn gye sɛ Agya no ama no ho ɛkwan” no.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Esiane saa nsɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no enti, nʼakyidifoɔ no mu pii twee wɔn ho firii ne ho na wɔanni nʼakyi bio.<verse eid="JHN 6:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Yesu hunuu saa no, ɔbisaa asuafoɔ dumienu no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo nso mobɛgyae mʼakyidie anaa?”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simon Petro buaa no sɛ, “Awurade, hwan nkyɛn na yɛbɛkɔ? Wo na wowɔ nsɛm a ɛwɔ nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Na yɛgye wo nsɛm no di na yɛnim sɛ wone Onyankopɔn Ba Kronkron no.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesu kɔɔ so kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me ara na meyii mo dumienu yi, nanso mo mu baako yɛ ɔbonsam.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no, na ɛfa Yuda a ɔyɛ Simon Iskariot ba no a ɔyɛ asuafoɔ dumienu no mu baako a ɔbɛyi Yesu ama no ho.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ho Akyinnyegyeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Yei akyi no, Yesu tenaa Galilea a wampɛ sɛ ɔbɛsane akɔ Yudea, ɛfiri sɛ, na Yudafoɔ no rehwehwɛ no akum no. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ Asese Afahyɛ no reyɛ aduru no, <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Yesu nuanom ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ɛsɛ sɛ wofiri ha sane kɔ Yudea sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ na wʼakyidifoɔ bɛhunu nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a woyɛeɛ no. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔgye edin a, ɔmmfa ne nneyɛeɛ nsie. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔma nnipa nyinaa hunu ne nneyɛeɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Na ne nuanom mpo nnye no nni.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me berɛ nnuruiɛ; na mo deɛ, ɛberɛ biara yɛ ma mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/><char style="wj">Mo deɛ nnipa tan mo a ɛnyɛ yie, nanso me deɛ wɔtan me a ɛyɛ yie, ɛfiri sɛ, daa meka bɔne a wɔyɛ no kyerɛ wɔn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/><char style="wj">Mo deɛ, monni ɛkan nkɔ afahyɛ no, na me deɛ, mennya nkɔeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, me berɛ nnuruiɛ.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Ɔkaa saa asɛm yi kyerɛɛ wɔn akyi no, ɔtenaa Galilea.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Yesu nuanom, kɔeɛ akyi no, ɔno nso kɔɔ afahyɛ no ase bi a wamma obiara anhunu no. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Yudafoɔ mpanin no hwehwɛɛ no afahyɛ no ase na wɔanhunu no no, wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Onipa a yɛrehwehwɛ no no wɔ he?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Nnipa no kaa ne ho nsɛm huhuhuhu ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔsuro Yudafoɔ mpanin no. Ebinom se, “Ɔyɛ onipa pa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:12">Na afoforɔ nso se, “Ɔyɛ ɔdaadaafoɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Yudafoɔ mpanin no ho hu enti, obiara antumi annyi nʼanim anka ne ho asɛm wɔ badwa mu.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kyerɛ Ne Tumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Afahyɛ no mfimfini no, Yesu kɔɔ asɔredan mu kɔkyerɛkyerɛeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ mpanin no tee Yesu nkyerɛkyerɛ no, ɛyɛɛ wɔn nwanwa na wɔbisaa sɛ, “Onipa yi nsuaa nwoma da, na ɛyɛɛ dɛn na ɔtumi kyerɛkyerɛ sɛɛ yi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛ merekyerɛ no mfiri mʼankasa, na mmom ɛfiri Onyankopɔn a ɔsomaa me no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn apɛdeɛ a, ɔbɛhunu sɛ me nkyerɛkyerɛ no firi Onyankopɔn nkyɛn anaa ɛfiri mʼankasa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔde nʼadwene kasa no pɛ animuonyam ma ne ho, na obiara a ɔpɛ animuonyam ma deɛ ɔsomaa no no yɛ ɔnokwafoɔ a nnaadaa biara nni ne mu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/><char style="wj">Mose amma mo mmara anaa? Nanso, mo mu biara nni saa mmara no so! Adɛn enti na mopɛ sɛ mokum me?”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Nnipa no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Gyama honhommɔne bi hyɛ wo so? Hwan na ɔrehwehwɛ wo akum wo?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Anwanwadeɛ baako pɛ a mayɛ enti na mo ho adwiri mo sɛɛ yi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/><char style="wj">Mose maa mo twetiatwa (mpo ɛnyɛ sɛ Mose na ɔhyɛɛ ho mmara na ɛyɛ mo nananom) nanso, motwa twetia homeda.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/><char style="wj">Sɛ motwa twetia homeda na moanto Mose mmara a, adɛn enti na sɛ masa obi yadeɛ homeda a, mo bo fu me?</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/><char style="wj">Mommmu atɛn kwa. Monhwɛ biribiara a mohunu no yie ansa na moabu ho atɛn.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ne Agyenkwa No Anaa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Nnipa a na wɔwɔ Yerusalem no mu bi bisaa sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ saa onipa yi ne deɛ wɔpɛ sɛ wɔkum no no anaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Ɔno na ɔrekasa badwa mu a obiara nka hwee nkyerɛ no yi! Gyama afei deɛ mpanimfoɔ no agye no ato mu sɛ ɔne Agyenkwa no. <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Yɛnim sɛ Agyenkwa no nya ba a, obiara rentumi nkyerɛ faako a ɔfiri baeɛ, nanso saa onipa yi deɛ, yɛnim faako a ɔfiri.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Yesu gu so rekyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔredan mu no, ɔteaa mu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛwom sɛ monim me na monim faako nso a mefiri baeɛ, nanso, ɛnyɛ me ara me pɛ na mede baeɛ, na deɛ ɔsomaa me no yɛ ɔnokwafoɔ, nanso monnim no;</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/><char style="wj">na me deɛ, menim no ɛfiri sɛ, mefiri ne nkyɛn na mebaeɛ na ɔno na ɔsomaa me.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Nʼano siiɛ no, wɔpɛɛ sɛ anka wɔkyere no nanso obiara antumi amfa ne nsa anka no, ɛfiri sɛ, na ne berɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkyere no no nnuruiɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Nnipa no mu fa kɛseɛ no ara gyee no dii, na wɔbisaa sɛ, “Sɛ Agyenkwa no ba a, ɔbɛtumi ayɛ anwanwadeɛ bebree sene deɛ ɔbarima yi ayɛ no anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Farisifoɔ no tee huhuhuhu no a nnipa no yɛ faa Yesu ho no, wɔne asɔfoɔ mpanin no somaa asɔrefie awɛmfoɔ bi sɛ wɔnkɔkyere Yesu mmra.<verse eid="JHN 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nnipakuo no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nna kakra bi na aka me a me ne mo bɛtena na masane akɔ deɛ ɔsomaa me no nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/><char style="wj">Mobɛhwehwɛ me, nanso morenhunu me, ɛfiri sɛ, faako a merekɔ no morentumi nkɔ hɔ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ mpanin no tee asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no, wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Ɛhefa na ɔse ɔrebɛkɔ a enti yɛrenhunu no yi? Anaasɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔkɔ Helafoɔ nkuro a Yudafoɔ tete mu no mu kɔkyerɛkyerɛ wɔn? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Sɛ ɔka sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Mobɛhwehwɛ me, nanso morenhunu me, ɛfiri sɛ, faako a merekɔ no morentumi nkɔ hɔ’</char> a, na ɔkyerɛ sɛn?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsuo A Ɛma Nkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Afahyɛ no da a ɛdi akyire a ɛyɛ da titire no, Yesu sɔre gyinaa hɔ kasaa denden sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obiara a osukɔm de no no mmra me nkyɛn mmɛnom nsuo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/><char style="wj">Na Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ, ‘Obiara a ɔgye me di no, nsuo a ɛma nkwa bɛtene afiri ne mu.’ ”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Yesu kaa saa asɛm yi faa Honhom Kronkron a wɔn a wɔgyee no diiɛ no nsa bɛka no ho. Saa ɛberɛ no, na ɔnnya mfaa Honhom Kronkron no mmaa wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔnnya mmaa ne so nkɔɔ ɔsoro, nhyɛɛ no animuonyam.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Nnipa no tee asɛm a Yesu kae no, ebinom kaa sɛ, “Ampa ara, onipa yi ne odiyifoɔ no!”<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Afoforɔ nso kaa sɛ, “Ɔno ne Kristo no!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Ebinom nso bisaa sɛ, “Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na Kristo no bɛfiri Galilea? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Atwerɛsɛm no anka sɛ, saa Kristo no bɛfiri Dawid abusua mu, na wɔbɛwo no wɔ Betlehem kuro a Dawid tenaa mu no mu anaa?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Yesu enti, nnipa no mu kyekyɛeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Ebinom pɛɛ sɛ wɔkyere no, nanso obiara amfa ne nsa anka no.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudafoɔ Mpanin Akyinnyegyeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Asomfoɔ no sane kɔeɛ no, asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Farisifoɔ no bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Adɛn enti na moamfa no amma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Asomfoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Nsɛm a onipa no ka no, ɛyɛ nwanwa na yɛntee bi da.”<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Farisifoɔ no sane bisaa asomfoɔ no sɛ, “Mo nso wadaadaa mo anaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Moahunu sɛ mpanimfoɔ anaa Farisifoɔ no bi agye no adi anaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Dabi, ɛremma saa, na mmom ɛyɛ wɔn a wɔnnim mmara no na wɔadome wɔn no na wɔbɛgye no adi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na Nikodemo a ɔyɛ Farisini a da bi ɔwiaa ne ho kɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn anadwo no nso wɔ hɔ bi. <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>Ɔno na ɔbisaa sɛ, “Enti yɛn mmara ma ho kwan ma yɛbu obi fɔ wɔ ɛberɛ a yɛntee nʼanom asɛm, nhunuu deɛ wayɛ anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Wo nso wofiri Galilea anaa? Hwehwɛ Atwerɛsɛm no mu yie na wobɛhunu sɛ odiyifoɔ biara rentumi mfiri Galilea da.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Afei, obiara firii hɔ kɔeɛ a wɔantumi ansi gyinaeɛ biara.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Yesu sane kɔɔ Ngo Bepɔ no so.<verse eid="JHN 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbaa Dwamanfoɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Adeɛ kyee anɔpa no, ɔsane baa asɔrefie. Nnipa bebree baa ne nkyɛn ma ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ kyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Ɔgu so rekasa no, Yudafoɔ mpanin ne Farisifoɔ de ɔbaa bi a wɔkyeree no sɛ ɔrebɔ adwaman baa nʼanim. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Wɔka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, yɛkyeree ɔbaa yi sɛ ɔrebɔ adwaman, <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>nanso Mose mmara hyɛ yɛn sɛ, ɔbaa biara a wɔbɛkyere no saa ɛkwan no so no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsi no aboɔ. Ɛdeɛn na woka wɔ ho?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Wɔbisaa no yei de sum no afidie sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛnya asɛm bi agyina so atoto nʼano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Nanso, Yesu bɔɔ ne mu ase de ne nsateaa twerɛtwerɛɛ fam. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Wɔgu so rebisabisa no nsɛm no, ɔmaa ne mu so ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo mu biara a ɔnyɛɛ bɔne da no, nni ɛkan nto boɔ mmɔ no.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Ɔsane bɔɔ ne mu ase twerɛtwerɛɛ fam.<verse eid="JHN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Nnipa no tee asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no, wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ firii hɔ mmaako mmaako firi mpanin no so. Ɛkaa Yesu ne ɔbaa no nko ara. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Yesu maa ne mu so no, ɔbisaa ɔbaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nnipa a wɔde wo baeɛ no wɔ he? Wɔn mu baako mpo nni ha a ɔbɛka asɛm bi atia wo?”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Ɔbaa no buaa Yesu sɛ, “Dabi, Owura.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ saa na ɛte deɛ a, ɛnneɛ me nso menni asɛm biara a mɛka de atia wo. Kɔ, na nkɔyɛ bɔne bio.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Ewiase Hann</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Yesu sane toaa ne kasa no so ka kyerɛɛ nnipa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mene ewiase hann no. Obiara a ɔdi mʼakyi no rennante sum mu da, na ɔbɛnya hann a ɛkyerɛ nnipa ɛkwan ma wɔkɔ nkwa mu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Farisifoɔ no tee asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no, wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Asɛm a woreka yi, yɛrennye nto mu, ɛfiri sɛ, wo ara na woredi wo ho adanseɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesu nso buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ me ara meredi me ho adanseɛ mpo a, asɛm a meka no yɛ nokorɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, menim faako a mefiri baeɛ ne faako a merekɔ. Na mo deɛ, monnim faako a mefiri baeɛ ne faako nso a merekɔ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/><char style="wj">Mo ankasa mode mo adwene na ɛbu atɛn na me deɛ, memmu obiara atɛn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/><char style="wj">Nanso, sɛ ɛba sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ mebu atɛn a, mʼatemmuo bɛyɛ atɛntenenee, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnyɛ me nko na mɛbu atɛn; Agya a ɔsomaa me no ka me ho.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/><char style="wj">Wɔatwerɛ wɔ mo mmara mu sɛ, sɛ adansefoɔ baanu adanseɛ hyia a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ wɔn adanseɛ no yɛ nokorɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/><char style="wj">Medi me ho adanseɛ na mʼAgya a ɔsomaa me no nso di me ho adanseɛ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Nnipa no bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛhe na wʼAgya no wɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnim me, na monnim mʼAgya no nso. Sɛ monim me a, anka mobɛhunu mʼAgya no nso.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesu kaa yeinom nyinaa ɛberɛ a na ɔrekyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔredan no mu sikakorabea hɔ no. Obiara antumi amfa ne nsa anka no, ɛfiri sɛ, na ne berɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkyere no no nnuruiɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Yesu sane ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mɛfiri mo nkyɛn makɔ; mobɛhwehwɛ me, na morenhunu me. Na mo deɛ, mobɛwu wɔ mo mu. Faako a merekɔ no morentumi mma hɔ bi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Yudafoɔ no bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Ɛhe na ɔrekɔ a ɔse <char style="wj">‘obi rentumi nkɔ hɔ bi no?’</char> Gyama ɔrekɔkum ne ho?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo deɛ, mofiri asase so ha, nanso me deɛ, mefiri ɔsoro na mebaeɛ. Mo deɛ, mofiri ewiase, nanso me deɛ, memfiri ewiase,</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/><char style="wj">Ɛno enti na meka kyerɛ mo sɛ mobɛwu wɔ mo bɔne mu no. Na sɛ moannye anni sɛ, mene deɛ mene a, mobɛwu wɔ mo bɔne mu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Wo koraa, wone hwan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mene deɛ daa meka kyerɛ mo sɛ meyɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/><char style="wj">Mewɔ mo ho nsɛm pii a anka mɛka atia mo. Nanso, deɛ ɔsomaa me no yɛ ɔnokwafoɔ na asɛm a meka no yɛ deɛ mate afiri ne nkyɛn.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Nnipa no ante no aseɛ sɛ nʼagya ho asɛm na ɔreka akyerɛ wɔn no. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ monya ma Onipa Ba no so wɔ asɛnnua no so a, na mobɛhunu sɛ, mene deɛ mene no, na afei mobɛhunu bio sɛ memfiri me ara me pɛ mu nyɛ biribiara, na mmom, deɛ Agya no somaa me sɛ menka no nko ara na meka.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔsomaa me no ka me ho daa. Ɔnnyaa me da, ɛfiri sɛ, meyɛ deɛ ɛsɔ nʼani.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Nnipa a wɔtee deɛ Yesu kaeɛ no mu dodoɔ no ara gyee no diiɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudafoɔ Ahohoahoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ Yudafoɔ a wɔgyee no diiɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ modi me nsɛm so a, moyɛ mʼasuafoɔ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/><char style="wj">Ɛno ansa na mobɛhunu nokorɛ no na nokorɛ no bɛma mo ade mo ho.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Nnipa no buaa no sɛ, “Yɛn deɛ yɛyɛ Abraham asefoɔ. Yɛnkɔɔ nkoasom mu da, na ɛyɛ dɛn na woka sɛ wobɛma yɛade yɛn ho?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ obiara a ɔyɛ bɔne no yɛ bɔne akoa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/><char style="wj">Akoa biara nni kyɛfa wɔ abusua mu nanso ɔba deɛ, daa ɔwɔ kyɛfa wɔ abusua mu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/><char style="wj">Ɛno enti, sɛ ɔba no ma mode mo ho a, mobɛde mo ho ampa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/><char style="wj">Megye tom sɛ moyɛ Abraham asefoɔ nanso morehwehwɛ me akum me, ɛfiri sɛ, monni ne nkyerɛkyerɛ so.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/><char style="wj">Deɛ mʼAgya ayi akyerɛ me no na meka ho asɛm, na mo deɛ, deɛ mo agya aka akyerɛ mo no na modi so.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Nnipa no kaa sɛ, “Yɛn agya ne Abraham.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu nso ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Moyɛ Abraham asefoɔ ampa a, anka ne nnwuma a ɔyɛeɛ no bi pɛpɛɛpɛ na mobɛyɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/><char style="wj">Deɛ mayɛ ne sɛ maka nokorɛ a mote firii Agya no nkyɛn akyerɛ mo, nanso mohwehwɛ me akum me. Abraham anyɛ biribi a ɛte sɛ yei.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/><char style="wj">Moreyɛ deɛ mo agya yɛeɛ.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Nnipa no sane kaa sɛ, “Onyankopɔn nko ara ne Agya a yɛwɔ na yɛyɛ ne mma ankasa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ Onyankopɔn yɛ mo Agya ampa ara a anka mobɛdɔ me, ɛfiri sɛ, ne nkyɛn na mefiri baeɛ na mewɔ ha. Mamfiri me pɛ mu na mebaeɛ; ɔno na ɔsomaa me.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/><char style="wj">Adɛn enti na monte nsɛm a mereka yi ase? Ɛfiri sɛ, mompɛ sɛ mote aseɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/><char style="wj">Mo deɛ, ɔbonsam ne mo agya, na mopɛ sɛ moyɛ nneɛma a ɔyɛ no nso bi. Ɔyɛ owudifoɔ firi ahyɛaseɛ. Ɔnni nokorɛ da, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔnyɛ ɔnokwafoɔ. Sɛ ɔdi atorɔ a, ɛnyɛ nwanwa ɛfiri sɛ, ɔyɛ ɔtorofoɔ ne atorɔ agya.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/><char style="wj">Nanso me deɛ, ɛsiane sɛ meka nokorɛ enti na monnye me nni no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/><char style="wj">Mo mu hwan na ɔbɛtumi aka sɛ medi bɔne bi ho fɔ? Sɛ meka nokorɛ a, adɛn enti na monnye me nni?</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔfiri Onyankopɔn mu no tie Onyankopɔn asɛm. Na mo deɛ, ɛsiane sɛ momfiri Onyankopɔn mu no enti na montie nʼasɛm no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ne Abraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Yudafoɔ no bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Sɛ yɛka sɛ woyɛ Samariani a honhommɔne ahyɛ wo ma a, na yɛboa anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Menni honhommɔne. Medi mʼAgya ni na mo deɛ monni no ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/><char style="wj">Memmpere nhwehwɛ animuonyam mma mʼankasa me ho. Obi wɔ hɔ a ɔhwehwɛ ma me na ɔno nso na ɔdi ma me.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/><char style="wj">Meka nokorɛ pefee kyerɛ mo sɛ, obiara a ɔdi mʼasɛm so no renwu da.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Yudafoɔ no nso ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Afei na yɛahunu ampa ara sɛ wowɔ honhommɔne! Abraham wuiɛ. Adiyifoɔ no nso wuwuiɛ. Nanso, wo deɛ woka sɛ, ‘Obiara a ɔdi mʼasɛm so no renwu da.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Woyɛ kɛse sene yɛn agya Abraham anaa? Ɔwuiɛ; saa ara nso na adiyifoɔ no wuwuiɛ. Wosusu sɛ woyɛ hwan?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ mʼankasa mehyɛ me ho animuonyam a, mʼanimuonyam no nka hwee. MʼAgya a mo nso moka sɛ ɔyɛ mo Onyankopɔn no, ɔno na ɔhyɛ me animuonyam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/><char style="wj">Mo deɛ, monnim no, nanso me deɛ, menim no. Sɛ meka sɛ mennim no a na meyɛ ɔtorofoɔ sɛ mo ara. Menim no na madi nʼasɛm nso so.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/><char style="wj">Mo agya Abraham ani gyee sɛ ɔbɛhunu me ba a mɛba no. Ɔhunuiɛ na nʼani gyeeɛ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Yudafoɔ no nso bisaa no sɛ, “Wonnii mfeɛ aduonum koraa na ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wohunuu Abraham?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mereka nokorɛ pefee akyerɛ mo sɛ, ansa na wɔrebɛwo Abraham no, na mete ase.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Yudafoɔ no tasee aboɔ sɛ anka wɔde rebɛsi no, nanso Yesu kɔhintaeɛ. Yei akyi no, ɔfirii asɔredan no mu hɔ kɔeɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Onifirani Bi Yadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesu nam no, ɔhunuu aberanteɛ bi a wɔwoo no onifirani, <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Nʼasuafoɔ no bisaa no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, saa onifirani yi awofoɔ bɔne a wɔyɛeɛ anaa ɔno ankasa bɔne enti na ama nʼani afira yi?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ nʼawofoɔ anaa nʼankasa bɔne enti na nʼani afira. Na mmom, nʼani afira sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Onyankopɔn tumi bɛyɛ ne ho adwuma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ adesaeɛ nkyɛre ba no enti, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ deɛ ɔsomaa me no adwuma a ɔde ahyɛ yɛn nsa no. Sɛ adeɛ sa a, obiara ntumi nyɛ adwuma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/><char style="wj">Ɛberɛ a mewɔ ewiase yi deɛ, mene ewiase hann no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Ɔkaa saa no, ɔtee ntasuo guu fam de fotɔɔ dɔteɛ na ɔde dɔteɛ no sraa onifirani no ani so. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Kɔ ɔtadeɛ Siloa no mu, na kɔhohoro wʼanim.”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siloa nkyerɛaseɛ ne “Somaa”.</char></note> Onifirani yi kɔ kɔhohoroo nʼanim san baeɛ a, afei deɛ ohunu adeɛ.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Onifirani no afipamfoɔ a wɔhunuu no sɛ ɔte ɛkwan ho srɛsrɛ adeɛ no hunuu no no, wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ aberanteɛ a na ɔsrɛsrɛ adeɛ no ni?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Ebinom kaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ ɔno,” na afoforɔ nso kaa sɛ, “Dabi, ɛnyɛ ɔno, na mmom, sɛ na ɔsɛ no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Aberanteɛ yi kaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ me.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Nnipa no bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛyɛɛ dɛn na afei wohunu adeɛ yi?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, “Ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Yesu no fotɔɔ dɔteɛ na ɔde sraa mʼani so na ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, ‘Kɔ ɔtadeɛ Siloa mu na kɔhohoro wʼanim’. Enti, mekɔeɛ. Mehohoroo mʼanim wieeɛ pɛ na mehunuu adeɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Wɔsane bisaa no bio sɛ, “Saa Yesu no wɔ he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, “Mennim.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisifoɔ Nsɛmmisa Wɔ Ayaresa No Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Wɔde aberanteɛ a na nʼani afira no brɛɛ Farisifoɔ no. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Ɛda a Yesu saa onifirani no yadeɛ no, na ɛyɛ homeda. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Farisifoɔ no nso bisaa aberanteɛ no sɛdeɛ ɛyɛeɛ a afei deɛ ɔhunuu adeɛ. Aberanteɛ no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛdeɛ Yesu de dɔteɛ a wɔafɔtɔ sraa nʼani so na ɔkɔhohoroeɛ na ɔhunuu adeɛ no.<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Farisifoɔ no mu bi kaa sɛ, “Onipa a ɔyɛɛ saa adeɛ yi mfiri Onyankopɔn hɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔnni homeda mmara no so.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Afoforɔ nso kaa sɛ, “Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ a ɔte sɛɛ yi bɛtumi ayɛ saa anwanwadwuma yi?” Saa akyinnyeɛ yi maa mpaapaemu baa wɔn mu.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Afei Farisifoɔ yi sane bisaa aberanteɛ no sɛ, “Wo na wose ɔma wohunuu adeɛ, ɛdeɛn asɛm na woka fa ne ho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Aberanteɛ yi buaa sɛ, “Megye di sɛ ɔyɛ odiyifoɔ a ɔfiri Onyankopɔn nkyɛn.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Yudafoɔ no annye anni ara da sɛ, na saa aberanteɛ no yɛ onifirani a afei deɛ ɔhunu adeɛ, kɔsi sɛ wɔsoma ma wɔkɔfrɛɛ nʼawofoɔ baeɛ <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>ma wɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, “Mo ba ni anaa? Mokyerɛ sɛ mowoo no no, na ɔyɛ onifirani anaa? Ɛyɛɛ dɛn na afei deɛ ɔhunu adeɛ yi?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Nʼawofoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Yɛgye tom sɛ ɔyɛ yɛn ba, na yɛwoo no no nso, na ɔyɛ onifirani. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Nanso yɛnnim deɛ enti a afei deɛ ɔhunu adeɛ yi. Saa ara nso na yɛnnim onipa ko a ɔma ɔhunuu adeɛ no. Ɔno ara ni, nʼani nso afi a ɔbɛtumi akasa ama ne ho enti mommisa no.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Deɛ ɛmaa nʼawofoɔ no kaa saa ne sɛ, na wɔsuro Yudafoɔ mpanimfoɔ no a wɔaka sɛ, obiara a ɔbɛka sɛ Yesu ne Agyenkwa no no, wɔbɛpam no afiri asɔredan no mu hɔ no. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Yei enti na nʼawofoɔ no kaa sɛ, “Nʼani afi a ɔbɛtumi akasa ama ne ho enti mommisa no” no.<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Wɔsane frɛɛ aberanteɛ a na ɔyɛ onifirani no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Hyɛ bɔ wɔ Onyankopɔn din mu sɛ, asɛm a yɛrebɛbisa wo yi wobɛdi nokorɛ. Yɛnim sɛ saa ɔbarima yi yɛ ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Aberanteɛ no buaa wɔn sɛ, “Me deɛ, sɛ ɔyɛ ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ o, sɛ nso ɔyɛ onipa pa o, ɛno deɛ, mennim. Deɛ menim ara ne sɛ, kane no na meyɛ onifirani na afei deɛ mehunu adeɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Wɔbisaa no bio sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na ɔyɛɛ wo ma wohunuu adeɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Aberanteɛ no de abufuo buaa wɔn sɛ, “Maka nokorɛ no akyerɛ mo, nanso moantie. Ɛdeɛn bio na mopɛ sɛ meka kyerɛ mo? Anaasɛ mo nso mopɛ sɛ mobɛyɛ nʼasuafoɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Mpanimfoɔ no yeyaa no sane kaa sɛ, “Wo mmom na woyɛ saa akoa no suani; na yɛn deɛ, yɛyɛ Mose asuafoɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Yɛnim pefee sɛ Onyankopɔn kasa kyerɛɛ Mose, nanso saa Yesu yi deɛ, faako a ɔfiri mpo, yɛnnim!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Aberanteɛ yi ka kyerɛɛ mpanimfoɔ no sɛ, “Ɛyɛ me nwanwa yie sɛ obi a ɔtumi ma onifirani hunu adeɛ no, motumi ka sɛ monnim faako a ɔfiri. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Yɛnim sɛ Onyankopɔn ntie nnebɔneyɛfoɔ asɛm; na mmom ɔtie nnipa a wɔdi no ni na wɔyɛ nʼapɛdeɛ no. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Ɛfiri adebɔ ahyɛaseɛ yɛntee da sɛ obi ama onifirani ahunu adeɛ da; <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>sɛ ɔbarima yi mfiri Onyankopɔn hɔ a, anka ɔrentumi nyɛ anwanwadeɛ a ɛte sei.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Mpanimfoɔ no nso de abufuo buaa no sɛ, “Ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ te sɛ wo na wopɛ sɛ wokyerɛkyerɛ yɛn?” Wɔsunsum no firii asɔredan no mu hɔ.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Honhom Mu Anifiraeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu tee sɛ wɔsunsum aberanteɛ no firii asɔredan no mu hɔ no no, ɔhwehwɛɛ no bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wogye Onipa Ba no di anaa?”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Aberanteɛ no buaa no sɛ, “Me wura, kyerɛ me saa Onipa Ba no sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mɛgye no adi!”<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Woahunu no dada; ɔno na ɔne wo rekasa yi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Aberanteɛ no de anigyeɛ kaa sɛ, “Awurade, megye medi.” Afei, ɔkotoo Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mebaa ewiase ha sɛ merebɛbu atɛn, na mama wɔn a wɔyɛ anifirafoɔ no ahunu adeɛ, na makyerɛ wɔn a wɔgye di sɛ wɔhunu adeɛ no sɛ, wɔyɛ anifirafoɔ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Farisifoɔ a na wɔgyinagyina hɔ no bisaa no sɛ, “Wopɛ sɛ wokyerɛ sɛ yɛyɛ anifirafoɔ anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ. <char style="wj">“Sɛ mogye tom sɛ moyɛ anifirafoɔ a, ɛnneɛ anka monni deɛ maka no ho fɔ. Esiane sɛ mogye to mu sɛ mohunu adeɛ enti motena afɔbuo mu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Odwanhwɛfoɔ Pa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo, onipa biara a ɔmfa nnwammuo ɛkwan ano na ɔforo kɔ mu no yɛ owifoɔ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/><char style="wj">Onipa a ɔfa ɛkwan ano kɔ mu no ne odwanhwɛfoɔ no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/><char style="wj">Ɛpono no anohwɛfoɔ no bue ɛpono no ma no, na sɛ ɔfrɛ nnwan no nso a, wɔte ne nne ma ɔde wɔn firi adi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɔde wɔn firi adi a, ɔdi nnwan no anim na nnwan no nso di nʼakyi, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔte ne nne.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/><char style="wj">Wɔrenni onipa foforɔ biara akyi. Na sɛ ɔfrɛ wɔn a, wɔremma, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnte ne nne.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesu buu wɔn saa bɛ yi nanso nnipa no ante no ase.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ, mene nnwammuo no ano ɛpono no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔdii mʼanim kane no yɛ awifoɔ ne adwotwafoɔ, ɛno enti, nnwan no ante wɔn nne, anni wɔn akyi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/><char style="wj">Mene ɛpono no. Obiara a ɔnam me so bɛwura mu no bɛnya nkwa; wɔbɛwura mu asane afiri adi na wɔbɛnya adidibea.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/><char style="wj">Owifoɔ ba a, ɔbɛwia anaasɛ ɔbɛdi awu anaasɛ ɔbɛsɛe adeɛ. Me deɛ, maba, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mobɛnya nkwa a ɛho nni asɛm biara.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mene odwanhwɛfoɔ pa no. Odwanhwɛfoɔ pa no ne obi a ɔtumi de ne nkwa to hɔ ma ne nnwan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/><char style="wj">Obi a wɔabɔ no paa sɛ ɔnhwɛ nnwan so no nyɛ nnwan no wura ɛno enti, sɛ ɔhunu sɛ pataku reba a, ɔdwane gya nnwan no hɔ, na pataku no to hyɛ nnwan no so ma wɔbɔ pete.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/><char style="wj">Ɔpaani no dwane ɛfiri sɛ, wɔabɔ no paa, na nnwan no yiedie mfa ne ho.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mene odwanhwɛfoɔ pa no. Menim me nnwan na me nnwan nso nim me,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/><char style="wj">sɛdeɛ Agya no nim me na me nso menim Agya no. Masiesie me ho nso sɛ mɛwu ama nnwan no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/><char style="wj">Nnwan afoforɔ bi wɔ hɔ a wɔyɛ me dea nanso wɔnnya mmɛkaa saa nnwankuo yi ho. Ɛsɛ sɛ mede wɔn nso bɛka saa nnwankuo yi ho. Wɔbɛtie me nne na wɔbɛyɛ nnwankuo baako a odwanhwɛfoɔ baako pɛ na ɔhwɛ wɔn so.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/><char style="wj">Agya no dɔ me ɛfiri sɛ, masiesie me ho sɛ mede me nkwa bɛto hɔ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a daakye me nsa bɛka bio.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/><char style="wj">Obiara rentumi nnye me nkwa mfiri me nsam. Me ara me pɛ mu na mede bɛma. Mewɔ tumi sɛ mede ma na mewɔ tumi nso sɛ mesane gye bio. Yei ne deɛ mʼAgya ahyɛ me sɛ menyɛ no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no enti, ɛmaa mpaapaemu baa Yudafoɔ no mu. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Wɔn mu pii kaa sɛ, “Ɔwɔ honhommɔne! Nʼadwene mu ka no! Adɛn enti na motie no?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Afoforɔ nso kaa sɛ, “Onipa a ɔwɔ honhommɔne rentumi nkasa sei! Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na obi a ɔwɔ honhommɔne bɛtumi ama onifirani ahunu adeɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudafoɔ Nnye Yesu Nni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Awɔberɛ bi mu a Asɔredandwira duruu wɔ Yerusalem no, <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesu kɔpasee asɔredan no mu baabi a wɔfrɛ no Salomo Abrannaa no so hɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Yudafoɔ no bɛtwaa ne ho hyiaeɛ kaa sɛ, “Wobɛma yɛatwɛn akɔsi da bɛn? Sɛ wone Kristo no a, pae mu ka kyerɛ yɛn.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Maka akyerɛ mo dada, nanso monnnye me nni. Me nnwuma a menam mʼAgya tumi mu yɛ no di me ho adanseɛ,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/><char style="wj">nanso monnnye nni, ɛfiri sɛ, monnyɛ me nnwan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/><char style="wj">Me nnwan te me nne, me nso menim wɔn na wɔdi mʼakyi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/><char style="wj">Mema wɔn nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ a wɔrenwu da, na obi rentumi nnye wɔn mfiri me nsam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/><char style="wj">MʼAgya a ɔde wɔn maa me no wɔ tumi sene obiara, na obiara rentumi nnye wɔn mfiri me nsam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/><char style="wj">Me ne Agya no yɛ baako.”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Yudafoɔ no sane tasee aboɔ sɛ anka wɔde rebɛsi no. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mayɛ nnwuma pa pii a Agya no de hyɛɛ me nsa sɛ menyɛ no ama moahunu, na emu deɛ ɛwɔ he ho enti na mopɛ sɛ mosi me aboɔ yi?”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Yudafoɔ no buaa no sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ wo nnwuma pa bi a woayɛ no enti na yɛpɛ sɛ yɛsi wo aboɔ, na mmom, wʼabususɛm a wokaeɛ no enti. Woyɛ onipa dasani nso woyɛ wo ho sɛ Onyankopɔn!”<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔatwerɛ wɔ mo ara ankasa mo mmara mu sɛ, Onyankopɔn kaa sɛ, ‘Moyɛ anyame.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/><char style="wj">Ɛno enti, sɛ Onyankopɔn nam anyamesɛm a ɛyɛ nokorɛ so frɛ wɔn a Onyankopɔn asɛm baa wɔn nkyɛn no sɛ ‘anyame’ a,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/><char style="wj">ɛyɛ dɛn na sɛ deɛ Agya no somaa no baa ewiase no ka sɛ, mene Onyankopɔn Ba no a mose waka abususɛm?</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/><char style="wj">Sɛ menyɛ nnwuma a mʼAgya pɛ sɛ meyɛ no deɛ a, ɛnneɛ monnnye me nni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/><char style="wj">Nanso, sɛ meyɛ mʼAgya no nnwuma na sɛ monnye me nni mpo a, monnye nnwuma no nni sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mobɛgye adi sɛ Agya no wɔ me mu na me nso mewɔ ne mu.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Nkurɔfoɔ no pɛɛ sɛ wɔkyere no bio, nanso wɔantumi.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Yesu sane tware kɔɔ Yordan agya wɔ faako a Yohane bɔ asu no kɔtenaa hɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Nnipa bebree kɔɔ ne nkyɛn. Wɔn mu dodoɔ no ara kaa sɛ, “Yohane anyɛ anwanwadeɛ, nanso biribiara a ɔka faa saa ɔbarima yi ho no yɛ nokorɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no mu bebree gyee no diiɛ.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Lasaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Ɔbarima bi tenaa ase wɔ Betania a na wɔfrɛ no Lasaro. Betania yi yɛ kuro a na Maria ne ne nua Marta firi mu. Ɛda bi, saa ɔbarima yi yareeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Saa Maria yi a ne nuabarima ne Lasaro a na ɔyare no, ɔno na ɔhwiee ngo guu Awurade nan ase de ne tirinwi pepaeɛ no. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Anuanom yi soma kɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Awurade, wo dɔfoɔ no yare.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Yesu tee nkra no, ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ saa yadeɛ yi na ɛbɛkum Lasaro. Mmom, Onyankopɔn pɛ sɛ ɔfa saa yadeɛ yi so hyɛ ne ho animuonyam, na saa animuonyam yi bi nso ka Onipa Ba no.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Na Yesu pɛ Maria ne ne nuabaa Marta ne Lasaro asɛm yie. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu tee nkra sɛ Lasaro yare dendeenden no, wankɔ saa ɛberɛ no ara mu; ɔtenaa hɔ nnanu. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momma yɛnsane nkɔ Yudea.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Nanso, asuafoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, ɛnkyɛree biara na Yudafoɔ no pɛɛ sɛ wɔsi wo aboɔ ɛnna afei wose yɛnsane nkɔ hɔ bio yi?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nnɔnhwere dumienu na ɛwɔ da koro mu, meboa anaa? Ɛno enti, sɛ obi nam hann mu a, ɔrensunti, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔnam ewiase hann mu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/><char style="wj">Nanso, sɛ ɔnam anadwo sum mu a, ɔbɛsunti, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔnam sum mu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Yesu sane kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yɛn adamfo Lasaro ada na merekɔ akɔnyane no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Asuafoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, sɛ wada deɛ a, ɛnneɛ na ne ho bɛtɔ no.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Na Yesu kyerɛ sɛ Lasaro awu, nanso asuafoɔ no deɛ, na wɔsusu sɛ nna ara na wada.<verse eid="JHN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Ɛno enti, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn pefee sɛ, <char style="wj">“Lasaro awu;</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/><char style="wj">nanso mo enti, ɛyɛ me anigye sɛ na menni hɔ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mobɛgye adi. Momma yɛnkɔ ne nkyɛn.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Toma a wɔfrɛ no Ata no ka kyerɛɛ ne mfɛfoɔ asuafoɔ no sɛ, “Momma yɛne Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no nyinaa nkɔ na yɛne no nkɔwu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lasaro Owuo Ne Ne Sie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Yesu duruu Betania no, na Lasaro awu ma wɔasie no ma adi nnanan. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Ɛfiri Betania rekɔ Yerusalem no nnuru akwansini mmienu, <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>na saa ɛberɛ no, na Yudafoɔ bebree aba Marta ne Maria nkyɛn sɛ wɔrebɛgyam wɔn wɔ wɔn nua no wuo no ho. <verse eid="JHN 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Marta tee sɛ Yesu reba no, ɔfirii adi kɔhyiaa no, na Maria deɛ, ɔtenaa efie.<verse eid="JHN 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Marta ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ao, Awurade, sɛ wowɔ ha a, anka me nua no anwu! <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Menim mpo sɛ saa ɛberɛ yi mu biribiara a wobɛbisa Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔnyɛ mma wo no, ɔbɛyɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo nua no bɛsane anya nkwa bio.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Marta buaa no sɛ, “Awurade, menim sɛ owusɔreɛ da no ɔno nso bɛsɔre.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me na menyane awufoɔ ma wɔn nkwa. Obiara a ɔgye me di no, sɛ wawu mpo a, ɔbɛsane anya nkwa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔte ase na ɔgye me di no, renwu da. Wogye yei di anaa?”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Marta buaa sɛ, “Awurade, megye medi. Megye medi sɛ wone Kristo Agyenkwa a ɔne Onyankopɔn Ba a ɔreba ewiase no.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Su Lasaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Marta kaa saa asɛm yi wieeɛ no, ɔkɔfrɛɛ ne nua Maria de no kɔɔ kɔkoam ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no aba na wabisa wʼase.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Maria tee saa asɛm yi no, ɔyɛɛ ntɛm kɔhyiaa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Yesu mmɛduruu akuraa no ase hɔ. Na ɔda so wɔ faako a Marta hyiaa no hɔ no. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ a wɔwɔ efie hɔ regyam Maria no hunuu sɛ wasɔre ɔherɛ so refiri adi no, wɔdii nʼakyi, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔsusu sɛ ɔrekɔ da no so akɔsu.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Maria duruu faako a Yesu wɔ no, ɔtotoo ne nan ase kaa sɛ, “Ao, Awurade, sɛ wowɔ ha, a anka me nua no anwu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesu hunuu sɛ Maria ne Yudafoɔ a wɔka ne ho no resu no, ɛhaa no yie na ne werɛ hoeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛhe na mosiee no?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Awurade, bra na yɛnkɔkyerɛ wo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesu suiɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Yudafoɔ no hunuu sɛ ɔresu no, wɔkaa sɛ, “Yei kyerɛ ɔdɔ a ɔde dɔ no.”<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Wɔn mu bi kaa sɛ, “Onipa a ɔmaa onifirani hunuu adeɛ no, monnnye nni sɛ anka ɔbɛtumi agye Lasaro nkwa anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Nyane Lasaro Firi Awufoɔ Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Asɛm a nkurɔfoɔ no kaeɛ no maa Yesu werɛ hoeɛ. Afei, ɔkɔɔ ɛda a wɔde ɛboɔ ahini ano no so. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesu hyɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monyi ɛboɔ a ɛhini ɛda no ano no.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Marta a ɔyɛ owufoɔ no nuabaa no kaa sɛ, “Awurade, ɛbɛyɛ nna ɛnan ni a yɛbɛsiee no enti saa ɛberɛ yi deɛ, ɛbɔn.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ Marta sɛ, <char style="wj">“Manka ankyerɛ wo sɛ, sɛ wogye di a wobɛhunu Onyankopɔn animuonyam?”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Wɔyii ɛboɔ no firii ɛda no ano. Afei, Yesu hwɛɛ ɛsoro, bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, <char style="wj">“Agya, meda wo ase sɛ wotie me.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/><char style="wj">Menim sɛ wotie me daa nyinaa, nanso ɛsiane nnipa a wɔwɔ ha enti na mereka yei sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔbɛgye adi sɛ wo na wosomaa me.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Ɔkaa yei wieeɛ no, ɔteaam denden sɛ, <char style="wj">“Lasaro, sɔre bra!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Lasaro sɔre baeɛ a ntoma a wɔde kyekyeree ne nsa ne ne nan ne nʼanim no da so kyekyere no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monsane ne ho ntoma no na ɔnkɔ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudafoɔ Bɔ Yesu Ho Pɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Yudafoɔ a wɔbɛsraa Maria na wɔhunuu deɛ Yesu yɛeɛ no mu bebree gyee no diiɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Na wɔn mu bi nso kɔɔ Farisifoɔ no hɔ kɔkaa deɛ ɛsiiɛ no nyinaa kyerɛɛ wɔn.<verse eid="JHN 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Enti Farisifoɔ no ne asɔfoɔ mpanin no hyiaa badwafoɔ no kaa sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na yɛnyɛ? Monhwɛ anwanwadeɛ a saa onipa yi reyɛ! <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Sɛ yɛma ɔkɔ so yɛ deɛ ɔreyɛ yi a, nnipa nyinaa bɛgye no adi na wɔadi nʼakyi. Sɛ ɛba saa a, Roma aban bɛbisa yɛn asɛm na wasɛe yɛn asɔredan ne ɔman mu yi nyinaa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Kaiafa a saa ɛberɛ no na ɔyɛ ɔsɔfopanin no kaa sɛ, “Mo deɛ, monnim hwee! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Monnim sɛ ɛyɛ ma mo sɛ onipa baako bɛwu ama nnipa no nyinaa sene sɛ wɔbɛsɛe ɔman mu no nyinaa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Ɛmfiri ɔno ankasa ne tumi mu na ɔkaa saa asɛm yi, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛsiane sɛ na ɔyɛ ɔsɔfopanin saa ɛberɛ no enti na ɔhyɛɛ nkɔm sɛ, “Yesu bɛwu de agye mo nkwa,” <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>na ɛnyɛ wɔn nko, na mmom, ɛnam yei so bɛma Onyankopɔn mma a wɔabɔ ahwete no nyinaa ano aboa, na wɔayɛ ɔman baako. <verse eid="JHN 11:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no, Yudafoɔ mpanin no faa adwene sɛ wɔbɛkum Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 11:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Yei enti, Yesu anyi ne ho adi wɔ Yudea, na ɔfirii hɔ kɔɔ ɛserɛ so kuro bi a wɔfrɛ no Efraim ne nʼasuafoɔ no kɔtenaa hɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Na Yudafoɔ Twam Afahyɛ no rebɛn enti nnipa pii fifirii wɔn nkuraaseɛ kɔɔ Yerusalem sɛ wɔrekɔdwira wɔn ho de atwɛn afahyɛ no. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Na wɔrehwehwɛ Yesu ahunu no. Ɛno enti, wɔduruu asɔredan mu hɔ no, wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Mogye di sɛ Yesu bɛba afahyɛ yi bi anaa?” Ebinom kaa sɛ, “Yɛnnye nni.” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Saa ɛberɛ yi na asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Farisifoɔ no ahyɛ sɛ, sɛ obi nim baabi a Yesu wɔ a, ɔnkyerɛ na wɔnkɔkye no.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsra Yesu Ngo Wɔ Betania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Aka nna nsia na Twam Afahyɛ no aduru no, Yesu kɔɔ Betania, kuro a na Lasaro a Yesu nyanee no firi awufoɔ mu no te mu no mu. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Wɔtoo Yesu ɛpono. Marta na ɔsomee wɔ saa apontoɔ yi ase. Lasaro tenaa Yesu nkyɛn pɛɛ wɔ ɛpono no ho. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Wɔredidi no, Maria faa ngohwam bi a ne boɔ yɛ den bɛhwie guu Yesu nan ase de ne tirinwi pepaeɛ. Ngo no hwa gyee efie hɔ nyinaa.<verse eid="JHN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Yuda Iskariot a ɔyɛ asuafoɔ no mu baako a akyire no ɔbɛyi Yesu ama no ani annye deɛ ɔbaa yi yɛeɛ no ho, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>enti ɔkaa sɛ, “Adɛn enti na wantɔn saa ngohwam yi na yɛamfa sika no amma ahiafoɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Ɛnyɛ sɛ na ɔdwene ahiafoɔ ho enti na ɔkaa saa asɛm yi, na mmom, na ɔyɛ ɔkorɔmfoɔ na ɛsiane sɛ na ɔhwɛ asuafoɔ no sika so enti, na ɔwiawia bi.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnyaa ɔbaa yi haw! Deɛ ɔbaa yi ayɛ yi, ɔde resiesie me ama me wuo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/><char style="wj">Mo ne ahiafoɔ na ɛwɔ hɔ ɛberɛ biara, na me deɛ, me ne mo rentena hɔ daa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ no tee sɛ Yesu wɔ Betania no, wɔn mu pii kɔɔ hɔ. Ɛnyɛ Yesu nko enti na wɔkɔɔ hɔ, na mmom, wɔkɔɔ hɔ sɛ wɔrekɔhwɛ Lasaro a Yesu nyanee no firii awufoɔ mu no nso. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Afei, asɔfoɔ mpanin no bɔɔ pɔ sɛ wɔbɛkum Lasaro nso, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>ɛfiri sɛ, ɛsiane Lasaro wusɔreɛ no enti, na nnipa bebree retwe wɔn ho afiri Yudafoɔ mpanin no ho abɛdi Yesu akyi.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, nnipadɔm a wɔaba Twam Afahyɛ no tee sɛ Yesu reba Yerusalem no, <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>wɔbubuu ɛberɛ de kɔhyiaa no ɛkwan de ahurisie teateaam sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hosiana!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:13"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Nhyira nka deɛ ɔreba wɔ Awurade din mu no!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:13"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Nhyira nka Israelhene!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yesu rekɔ no, na ɔte afunumu ba bi so sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm hyɛɛ ho nkɔm sɛ,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“Nsuro, Ɔbabaa Sion!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">Hwɛ sɛ wo ɔhene te afunumu ba so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">reba wo nkyɛn.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Ahyɛaseɛ no, asuafoɔ no ante yeinom nyinaa ase kɔsii sɛ wɔhyɛɛ Yesu animuonyam no ansa na wɔrekae sɛ, Atwerɛsɛm no aka saa asɛm yi nyinaa afa ne ho dada, na ɛno ara ne deɛ wɔayɛ no.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Nnipa a na wɔwɔ hɔ a wɔhunu sɛ Yesu nyanee Lasaro firii awufoɔ mu no kaa asɛm a ɛsii no kyerɛɛ afoforɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Yei enti na nnipa bebree kɔeɛ sɛ wɔrekɔhyia Yesu ɛkwan no, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔate sɛ wayɛ anwanwadeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Farisifoɔ no hunuu deɛ ɛrekɔ so no, wɔkaa sɛ, “Anyɛ yie! Monhwɛ sɛ nnipa no nyinaa atu adi nʼakyi!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Ne Owuo Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Afahyɛberɛ no mu no, Helafoɔ bi nso kɔɔ Yerusalem sɛ wɔrekɔsom. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Wɔkɔɔ Filipo a ɔfiri Betsaida no nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Owura, yɛpɛ sɛ yɛhunu Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filipo kɔbɔɔ Andrea amaneɛ maa wɔn baanu kɔka kyerɛɛ Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛberɛ no aso sɛ wɔbɛhyɛ Onipa Ba no animuonyam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/><char style="wj">Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ, sɛ wɔamfa burofua anhyɛ fam amma amporɔ na amfifiri a, ɛda so yɛ burofua no ara, nanso sɛ ɛporɔ na ɛfifiri a, ɛso aba pii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔdɔ ne kra no bɛhwere ne nkwa, na deɛ ɔnnɔ ne kra no ɔbɛnya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔsom me no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔdi mʼakyi, na baabiara a mewɔ no, ɛsɛ sɛ mʼasomfoɔ nso wɔ hɔ bi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Afei deɛ, me kra ho yera no na asɛm bɛn na menka? Menka sɛ, ‘Agya, gye me firi saa amanehunu yi mu anaa?’ Nanso, yei enti na wosomaa me baa ewiase sɛ memmɛhunu amane.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/><char style="wj">Agya, hyɛ wo din animuonyam!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Ɔkasa wieeɛ no, nne bi firi ɔsoro kaa sɛ, “Mahyɛ no animuonyam dada na mɛsane mahyɛ no bio.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Nnipakuo a na wɔwɔ hɔ no tee nne no, wɔkaa sɛ aprannaa na ɛrebobɔ mu. Ebinom nso kaa sɛ, ɔsoro ɔbɔfoɔ na ɔkasa kyerɛɛ no.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Nanso, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo enti na saa nne yi kasaeɛ na ɛnyɛ me enti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/><char style="wj">Afei, ɛberɛ aduru sɛ wɔbu ewiase atɛn na wɔtu ɔbonsam a ɔdi ewiase so no gu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wɔnya ma me so firi asase mu a, mɛtwe nnipa nyinaa aba me nkyɛn.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Ɔkaa yei de kyerɛɛ owuo ko a ɔbɛwu no.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Nnipa no kaa sɛ, “Atwerɛsɛm no di adanseɛ sɛ, Agyenkwa no renwu da. Adɛn enti na wɔka kyerɛ yɛn sɛ, <char style="wj">ɛsɛ sɛ wɔma Onipa Ba no so?</char> Hwan ne saa Onipa Ba no?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me hann no bɛhyerɛn ama mo mmerɛ tiawa bi mu. Ɛno enti, monnante mu ɛberɛ a mowɔ saa hann no mu yi nkɔ baabiara a mopɛ sɛ mokɔ, ansa na esum aduru; anyɛ saa a morenhunu kwan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/><char style="wj">Ɛberɛ a mowɔ hann mu yi, monnye hann no nni na moayɛ hann no mma.”</char> Yesu kaa nsɛm yi wieeɛ no, ɔfirii hɔ de ne ho kɔhintaeɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudafoɔ Gu So Gye Akyinnyeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Ɛwom sɛ na Yesu ayɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ ama Yudafoɔ no ahunu deɛ, nanso na wɔnnye no nni ara. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Yei ne Odiyifoɔ Yesaia asɛm a ɔkaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Awurade, hwan na wagye yɛn asɛnka adi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Na hwan nso na ɔbɛgye wʼanwanwadwuma no adi sɛ adansedie?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Yudafoɔ no annye anni ɛfiri sɛ, na Odiyifoɔ Yesaia asane aka sɛ,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>“Onyankopɔn afira wɔn ani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">na wapirim wɔn akoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔrentumi nnane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">mma me nkyɛn na masa wɔn yadeɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Yesaia kaa yei faa Yesu animuonyam a daakye ɔbɛnya a Onyankopɔn yi kyerɛɛ no no ho.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Mpo, na Yudafoɔ mpanin no mu pii gye Yesu di, nanso na wɔsuro sɛ, sɛ Farisifoɔ no hunu wɔn a, wɔremma wɔmma asɔredan no mu bio. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Na wɔpɛ sɛ nnipa bɛkamfo wɔn sene sɛ Onyankopɔn bɛhyɛ wɔn animuonyam.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yesu teaam sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔgye me di no, ɛnyɛ me nko na ɔgye me di, na ɔgye deɛ ɔsomaa me no nso di.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ ɔhunu me no hunu deɛ ɔsomaa me no nso.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/><char style="wj">Maba ewiase sɛ hann, na obiara a ɔgye me di no ankɔ so antena sum mu.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔte mʼasɛm na ɔnni so no, meremmu no atɛn. Ɛfiri sɛ, mamma sɛ merebɛbu nnipa atɛn, na mmom, mebaeɛ sɛ merebɛgye wɔn nkwa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔpo me na ɔnnye mʼasɛm nni no, ɔtemmufoɔ bi wɔ hɔ a ɔbɛbu no atɛn. Me nsɛm a maka akyerɛ mo no na Atemmuo da no ɛbɛbu mo atɛn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/><char style="wj">Nsɛm a maka no nyinaa, ɛnyɛ mʼankasa mʼadwene na mede ka kyerɛɛ mo, na mmom ɛyɛ deɛ Agya no ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ menka nkyerɛ mo no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/><char style="wj">Menim sɛ asɛm biara a Agya no ahyɛ me sɛ menka no de nnipa kɔ nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ mu; enti asɛm a ɔbɛka akyerɛ me sɛ menka biara no, ɛno na meka!”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hohoro Nʼasuafoɔ Nan Ase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Adeɛ rebɛkye ama Twam Afahyɛ no aduru no, Yesu hunuu sɛ afei, berɛ aso sɛ ɔfiri ewiase kɔ nʼAgya nkyɛn. Yesu yɛ obi a na ɔdɔ nʼakyidifoɔ, na ɔdɔɔ wɔn kɔsii sɛ ɔwuiɛ.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Ɛberɛ a na Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ te adidiiɛ no, ɔbonsam kɔhyɛɛ Yuda Iskariot a ɔyɛ Simon ba no mu sɛ ɔnyi Yesu mma. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yesu nim sɛ nʼAgya de tumi nyinaa ahyɛ ne nsa, na ɔfiri Onyankopɔn nkyɛn na ɔbaeɛ, na ɔresane akɔ ne nkyɛn. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Yesu sɔre firii didipono no ho, yii nʼatadeɛ ngugusoɔ guu hɔ, de mpepaho twaa nʼasene. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Ɔhwiee nsuo guu dwaresɛn bi mu na ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ hohoroo asuafoɔ no nan ase de mpepaho no pepaeɛ.<verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu duruu Simon Petro so no, Petro bisaa no sɛ. “Awurade, worebɛhohoro me nan ase anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛ mereyɛ yi, worente aseɛ seesei, nanso akyire no wobɛte aseɛ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Petro ampene asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no so kaa sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ wo na ɛsɛ sɛ wohohoro me nan ase.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ manhohoro wo nan ase a, na wonka me ho.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simon Petro kaa sɛ, “Awurade, ɛnneɛ na ɛnyɛ me nan ase nko, na mmom, me nsa ho ne me tirim nso ka ho.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obiara a wadware no, adwareɛ ho nhia no bio gye ne nan ase nko na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔhohoro, ne onipadua no deɛ, efi biara nni ho. Mo nyinaa ho ate, gye mo mu baako pɛ.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Na Yesu nim onipa ko a ɔrebɛyi no ama no, ɛno enti na ɔkaa sɛ ɛnyɛ wɔn nyinaa na wɔn ho ate no.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Yesu hohoroo wɔn nan ase wieeɛ no, ɔfaa nʼatadeɛ ngugusoɔ no hyɛeɛ, sane kɔtenaa didipono no ho. Afei, ɔbisaa nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mote deɛ mayɛ yi ase anaa?</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/><char style="wj">Mofrɛ me ‘Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ’ ne ‘Awurade’ a, modi me frɛ; ɛfiri sɛ, ɛno ne deɛ meyɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/><char style="wj">Sɛ me a meyɛ mo Awurade ne Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no mpo ahohoro mo nan ase a, ɛnneɛ, na ɛsɛ sɛ mo nso mohohoro hohoro mo ho mo ho nan ase.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/><char style="wj">Mayɛ yei de ayɛ nhwɛsoɔ ama mo sɛdeɛ mo nso mobɛyɛ saa ara.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/><char style="wj">Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ, akoa nsene ne wura; saa ara nso na ɔsomafoɔ nsene deɛ ɔsomaa no no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/><char style="wj">Afei a moate deɛ meyɛeɛ no ase yi, sɛ moyɛ saa bi a, mobɛnya nhyira.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ mo nyinaa na mereka saa asɛm yi akyerɛ mo, menim wɔn a mayi wɔn. Nanso, ɛsɛ sɛ Atwerɛsɛm a ɛka sɛ, ‘Onipa a ɔne me to nsa didi no, bɛyi me ama’ no ba mu.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mereka yeinom nyinaa akyerɛ mo ansa na aba mu sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mobɛgye adi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/><char style="wj">Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo sɛ, obiara a ɔbɛgye deɛ masoma no no, ɔgye me nso, na obiara a ɔgye me no nso gye deɛ ɔsomaa me no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Deɛ Ɔbɛyi No Ama Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Yesu kaa yeinom nyinaa wieeɛ no, ne ho yeraa no ma ɔpaee mu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo, mo mu baako bɛyi me ama!”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Asuafoɔ no de ahodwirie hwehwɛhwehwɛɛ wɔn ho wɔn ho anim pɛɛ sɛ wɔhunu deɛ ɔde no no. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Na asuafoɔ no mu baako a Yesu pɛ nʼasɛm no te ne nkyɛn pɛɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simon Petro buu nʼani sɛ, “Bisa no na ɔnkyerɛ wo onipa ko a ɔreka ne ho asɛm no.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Ɛno enti saa osuani no twe bɛn Yesu bisaa no sɛ, “Awurade, ɛyɛ hwan?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, “Deɛ mede burodo bɛbɔ mu ama no no, ɔno na ɔbɛyi me ama.” Na ɔde burodo bɔɔ mu de maa Yuda Iskariot a ɔyɛ Simon ba no. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Ɛberɛ a Yuda gyee burodo no pɛ na ɔbonsam bɛhyɛɛ ne mu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛ wopɛ sɛ woyɛ no, yɛ no ntɛm!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Wɔn a na wɔte adidiiɛ no mu biara ante asɛm a Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no no ase. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Esiane sɛ Yuda na ɔhwɛ asuafoɔ no sika so enti, na wɔsusu sɛ, Yesu reka akyerɛ no sɛ, ɔnkɔtɔ biribi a ɛho hia ma afahyɛ no anaasɛ ɔnkɔma ahiafoɔ biribi. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yuda gyee burodo no pɛ na ɔfirii adi; saa ɛberɛ no na ɛyɛ anadwo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahyɛdeɛ Foforɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yuda firii adi kɔeɛ akyi no, Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Afei na Onipa Ba no animuonyam ada adi; na Onyankopɔn nam Ɔba no so ada nʼanimuonyam adi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɛnam Ɔba no so na Onyankopɔn animuonyam da adi a, Onyankopɔn nso nam ne tumi so bɛda Onipa Ba no animuonyam adi. Ɔbɛyɛ yei ntɛm so.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Me mma, ɛrenkyɛre biara, mɛgya mo hɔ. Sɛdeɛ meka kyerɛɛ Yudafoɔ mpanin no, mobɛhwehwɛ me, nanso morentumi mma faako a merekɔ hɔ no.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ahyɛdeɛ foforɔ na mede regya mo sɛ, ‘Monnodɔ mo ho sɛdeɛ medɔ mo no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ mododɔ mo ho mo ho a, obiara bɛhunu sɛ moyɛ mʼasuafoɔ.’ ”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Petro Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simon Petro bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, ɛhe na worekɔ?” Yesu buaa no sɛ, “Faako a merekɔ no deɛ, worentumi nni mʼakyi; daakye bi wobɛba abɛka me ho.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Petro bisaa no sɛ, “Awurade, adɛn enti na merentumi nni wʼakyi saa ɛberɛ yi? Ɛyɛ owuo mpo a, mɛwu ama wo.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Woasiesie wo ho ampa ara sɛ wobɛwu ama me anaa? Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ wo sɛ, ansa na akokɔ bɛbɔn no, na woapa me mprɛnsa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ne Ɛkwan No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mommma mo akoma nntu. Monnye Onyankopɔn nni na monnye me nso nni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/><char style="wj">Tenaberɛ bebree wɔ mʼAgya efie, ɛno enti, merekɔ akɔsiesie baabi ama mo. Sɛ asɛm a mereka yi nyɛ nokorɛ a, anka merenka nkyerɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ mekɔ na mekɔsiesie baabi ma mo a, mɛsane aba abɛfa mo akɔ na me ne mo akɔtena.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/><char style="wj">Monim faako a merekɔ no ne ɛkwan ko a mobɛfa so aba hɔ bi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Toma bisaa no sɛ, “Awurade yɛnnim faako a worekɔ na yɛbɛyɛ dɛn ahunu ɛkwan aba hɔ bi?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mene ɛkwan no, ne nokorɛ no, ne nkwa no; obi ntumi nkɔ Agya no hɔ, gye sɛ ɔfa me so.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Yesu kaa bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Afei a moahunu onipa ko a meyɛ yi, saa ara nso na mobɛhunu mʼAgya no, na ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ yi monim no, ɛfiri sɛ, moahunu no!”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filipo bisaa no sɛ, “Awurade, kyerɛ yɛn Agya no, ɛfiri sɛ, deɛ yɛrehwehwɛ ara ne no.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Filipo, enti me ne mo nanteeɛ dadaada yi, wonnim onipa ko a meyɛ? Obiara a ɔnim onipa ko a meyɛ no nim mʼAgya no. Adɛn enti na woka sɛ, ‘Kyerɛ yɛn Agya’ no?</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/><char style="wj">Filipo wonnye nni sɛ mewɔ Agya no mu na Agya no nso wɔ me mu? Yesu sane ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, nsɛm a maka akyerɛ mo no mfiri mʼankasa. Agya a ɔte me mu no na ɔnam me so yɛ nʼadwuma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/><char style="wj">Monnye me nni sɛ mewɔ Agya no mu na Agya no nso wɔ me mu. Sɛ monnnye nsɛm a maka no nni a, nnwuma a mayɛ no enti, monnye nni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/><char style="wj">Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo, obiara a ɔgye me di no, bɛyɛ nnwuma a meyɛ no bi na mpo ɔbɛyɛ nnwuma akɛseakɛseɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, merekɔ mʼAgya no nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/><char style="wj">Na biribiara a mobɛbisa wɔ me din mu no, mɛyɛ ama mo, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Agya no animuonyam nam ne Ba no so bɛda adi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/><char style="wj">Biribiara a mode me din bɛbisa no, mɛyɛ ama mo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Honhom Kronkron Ho Bɔhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ modɔ me a, mobɛdi mʼahyɛdeɛ so.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/><char style="wj">Mɛbisa Agya no na wama mo ɔboafoɔ foforɔ a ɔne Honhom Kronkron no a ɔda Onyankopɔn nokorɛ nyinaa adi no na ɔne mo atena daa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/><char style="wj">Ewiase rentumi nnye no, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnhunu no, na wɔnnim no. Nanso, mo deɛ, monim no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔne mo na ɛte.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/><char style="wj">Merennya mo sɛ nwisiaa; mɛsane aba mo nkyɛn bio.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/><char style="wj">Ɛrenkyɛre biara nnipa renhunu me bio, nanso mo deɛ, mobɛhunu me; na ɛsiane sɛ mete ase no enti, mo nso mobɛtena ase.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/><char style="wj">Na da a mɛsɔre afiri awufoɔ mu no duru a, mobɛhunu sɛ mewɔ mʼAgya no mu, na mo nso mowɔ me mu, sɛdeɛ me nso mewɔ mo mu no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔdi mʼahyɛdeɛ so no ne obi a ɔdɔ me. Obiara a ɔdɔ me no mʼAgya bɛdɔ no, na me nso mɛdɔ no na mada me ho adi akyerɛ no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Yuda, a ɛnyɛ Iskariot, kaa sɛ, “Awurade, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na wobɛda wo ho adi akyerɛ yɛn nko ara na ɛnyɛ nnipa nyinaa?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔdɔ me no bɛdi me nsɛm so. MʼAgya bɛdɔ no na me ne mʼAgya bɛba ne nkyɛn ne no abɛtena.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔnnɔ me no renni me nsɛm so. Nsɛm a moate no nyɛ me ara me nsɛm, na mmom, ɛfiri mʼAgya a ɔsomaa me no nkyɛn.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mewɔ mo nkyɛn yi na mereka yeinom nyinaa akyerɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/><char style="wj">Honhom Kronkron no a ɔne ɔboafoɔ a Agya no bɛsoma no me din mu no, bɛkyerɛkyerɛ mo biribiara, na wakaakae mo biribiara a maka akyerɛ mo no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/><char style="wj">Asomdwoeɛ na mede regya mo; mʼasomdwoeɛ na mede regya mo. Ɛnyɛ ewiase asomdwoeɛ na mede regya mo. Mommma mo akoma nntu; na monnsuro nso.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monkae asɛm a meka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, ‘Merekɔ, nanso mɛsane aba mo nkyɛn bio’ no. Sɛ modɔ me ampa ara a, anka mo ani bɛgye, ɛfiri sɛ, afei deɛ, mɛtumi akɔ Agya a ɔwɔ tumi sene me no nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/><char style="wj">Maka yeinom akyerɛ mo sɛdeɛ ɛba mu a mobɛgye me adi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/><char style="wj">Merentumi nkɔ so nkasa pii nkyerɛ mo bio, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔbonsam no reba, nanso ɔnni me so tumi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/><char style="wj">Na ɛsɛ sɛ nnipa hunu sɛ medɔ Agya no, ɛno enti na asɛm biara a ɔbɛka no, meyɛ no.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">
    <char style="wj">“Monsɔre ma yɛnkɔ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Ɔyɛ Nokorɛ Bobe No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mene nokorɛ bobe no, na mʼAgya ne okuafoɔ no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/><char style="wj">Dua aban biara a ɛnso aba no, ɔtwa twene, na dua aban biara a ɛso no, ɔyiyi ho na aso aba bebree.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/><char style="wj">Me nsɛm a maka akyerɛ mo no ama mo ho ate dada.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/><char style="wj">Montena me mu na me nso mentena mo mu. Dua aban biara ankasa rentumi nso aba gye sɛ ɛfam ne dutan ho. Saa ara nso na morentumi nso aba gye sɛ mote me mu.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mene bobe no; na mone dua aban no. Obiara a ɔte me mu na mete ne mu no bɛso aba bebree; sɛ mokwati me a, morentumi nyɛ hwee.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔntena me mu no te sɛ dua aban a wɔatwa ato atwene a ɛho nni mfasoɔ; ɛwo a, wɔboaboa ano de gu ogya mu hye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mote me mu na me nsɛm nso tena mo mu a, ɛnneɛ biribiara a mopɛ a mobɛbisa no, wɔde bɛma mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔyɛ mʼasuafoɔ nokorɛ mu no so aba bebree de hyɛ mʼAgya animuonyam.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛdeɛ Agya no dɔ me no, saa ara nso na me nso medɔ mo, Montena me dɔ mu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/><char style="wj">Sɛ modi mʼahyɛdeɛ so a, mobɛtena me dɔ mu sɛdeɛ madi mʼAgya ahyɛdeɛ so na ɛno enti ɔda so dɔ me no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/><char style="wj">Maka yeinom nyinaa akyerɛ mo sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mobɛnya mʼanigyeɛ no bi na ama mo anigyeɛ awie pɛyɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/><char style="wj">Mʼahyɛdeɛ ne sɛ, monnodɔ mo ho mo ho sɛdeɛ medɔ mo no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/><char style="wj">Ɔdɔ biara nsene sɛ obi bɛwu ama ne nnamfonom.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/><char style="wj">Sɛ modi deɛ mehyɛ mo sɛ monyɛ no so a, na moyɛ me nnamfonom.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/><char style="wj">Memfrɛ mo nkoa bio, ɛfiri sɛ, akoa nnim deɛ ne wura reyɛ. Mmom, mefrɛ mo nnamfo, ɛfiri sɛ, maka biribiara a mete firii mʼAgya no nkyɛn akyerɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/><char style="wj">Ɛnyɛ mo na moyii me; me na meyii mo na memaa mo adwuma sɛ monkɔyɛ na monso aba pa bebree. Na biribiara a mode me din bɛbisa Agya no no, ɔde bɛma mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/><char style="wj">Yei na mehyɛ mo; monnodɔ mo ho.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewiase Tan Asuafoɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ ewiase tane mo a, monkae sɛ me na ɛtanee me kane ansa na ɛretane mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mote ase ma ewiase a, ɛnneɛ ewiase bɛdɔ mo sɛ wɔn a wɔyɛ ne dea. Nanso, meyii mo firii ewiasefoɔ mu, ɛno enti, monyɛ ewiasefoɔ bio; yei enti na ewiasefoɔ tan mo no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/><char style="wj">Monkae asɛm a meka kyerɛɛ mo no: ‘Akoa nsene ne wura.’ Sɛ wɔtan me a, mo nso, wɔbɛtan mo; sɛ wɔtie mʼasɛm a meka no a, mo nso, wɔbɛtie mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ moyɛ me dea enti na wɔbɛtaa mo, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnnim Onyankopɔn a ɔsomaa me no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/><char style="wj">Sɛ memmɛkaa asɛm biara nkyerɛɛ wɔn a, anka wɔrenni bɔne ho fɔ. Afei deɛ wɔnni wɔn bɔne ho anoyie biara.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔtan me no tan mʼAgya nso.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/><char style="wj">Sɛ manyɛ nnwuma a obiara nyɛɛ bi da no wɔ wɔn mu a, anka wɔrenni bɔne ho fɔ; nanso wɔahunu deɛ meyɛeɛ, nso wɔtan me ne mʼAgya.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/><char style="wj">Ɛsɛ sɛ yei ba mu sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a deɛ wɔatwerɛ wɔ wɔn Mmara no mu a ɛka sɛ, ‘Wɔtan me kwa’ no bɛba mu.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mɛsoma ɔboafoɔ a ɔyɛ nokorɛ Honhom a ɔfiri Agya no nkyɛn no aba mo nkyɛn na wabɛdi me ho adanseɛ akyerɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/><char style="wj">Na mo nso mobɛdi me ho adanseɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, me ne mo na ɛwɔ hɔ firi ahyɛaseɛ pɛɛ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Awerɛhoɔ Ne Anigyeɛ Wɔ Yɛn Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mereka yeinom nyinaa akyerɛ mo na moatumi agyina hɔ pintinn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/><char style="wj">Wɔbɛpam mo afiri wɔn asɔredan mu. Na ɛberɛ bi bɛba a obiara a ɔbɛkum mo no bɛsusu sɛ, sɛ ɔyɛ saa a, na ɔresom Onyankopɔn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/><char style="wj">Wɔde saa nneɛma yi bɛyɛ mo, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnnim Agya no na me nso wɔnnim me.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/><char style="wj">Nanso, mereka yei akyerɛ mo, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, sɛ ɛberɛ no duru a, mobɛkae deɛ meka kyerɛɛ mo no. Ahyɛaseɛ no, manka yei ankyerɛ mo, ɛfiri sɛ na meka mo ho.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Honhom Kronkron Dwumadie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei deɛ merekɔ deɛ ɔsomaa me no nkyɛn. Nanso, mo mu biara mmisaa me sɛ, ‘Ɛhe na worekɔ?’</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/><char style="wj">Deɛ maka akyerɛ mo yi ama mo werɛ aho.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/><char style="wj">Nanso, meka nokorɛ kyerɛ mo; ɛyɛ ma mo sɛ mɛkɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, sɛ mankɔ a, ɔboafoɔ no remma mo nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/><char style="wj">Nanso, sɛ mekɔ a, mɛsoma no aba mo nkyɛn. Na sɛ ɔba a, ɔbɛma ewiasefoɔ ahunu wɔn bɔne ne deɛ ɛyɛ tenenee ne Onyankopɔn atemmuo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/><char style="wj">Deɛ wɔka fa bɔne ho no nyɛ nokorɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnnye me nni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/><char style="wj">Deɛ wɔka fa tenenee ho no nyɛ nokorɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, merekɔ Agya no nkyɛn na morenhunu me bio.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/><char style="wj">Saa ara na deɛ wɔka fa atemmuo ho no nso nyɛ nokorɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔabu ewiase yi ɔtemmufoɔ no atɛn dada.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mewɔ nsɛm pii ka kyerɛ mo, nanso seesei deɛ, morentumi nte aseɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/><char style="wj">Sɛ nokorɛ Honhom no ba a, ɔbɛma moahunu nokorɛ no nyinaa. Ɔrenkasa mma ne ho, na mmom, deɛ ɔte no na ɔbɛka, na ɔbɛka nneɛma a ɛbɛba no ho nsɛm akyerɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/><char style="wj">Ɔbɛhyɛ me animuonyam, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔbɛtie asɛm biara a meka no na wabɛka akyerɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/><char style="wj">Biribiara a mʼAgya wɔ no yɛ me dea. Ɛno enti na mekaa sɛ, Honhom no bɛtie biribiara a meka kyerɛ no, na wabɛka akyerɛ mo no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awerɛhoɔ Ne Anigyeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Aka kakra bi morenhunu me, nanso ɛno akyi no, ɛrenkyɛre koraa, mobɛhunu me bio.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Asuafoɔ no bi bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Yei ase ne sɛn? Ɔreka akyerɛ yɛn sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Aka kakra bi morenhunu me nanso ɛno akyi no, ɛrenkyɛre koraa na moasane ahunu me.’</char> Ɔsane kaa bio sɛ, <char style="wj">‘Ɛfiri sɛ, merekɔ Agya no nkyɛn.’ ”</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Wɔsane bisaa bio sɛ, “Saa asɛm, <char style="wj">‘aka kakra’</char> yi aseɛ ne sɛn? Yɛnte deɛ ɔreka yi ase.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yesu hunuu sɛ wɔpɛ sɛ wɔbisa no asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no ase no enti, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mekaa sɛ, ‘aka kakra bi morenhunu me, nanso ɛno akyi no, ɛrenkyɛre koraa mobɛhunu me bio’. Yei ne asɛm a monte aseɛ a enti morebisabisa mo ho mo ho yi?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/><char style="wj">Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo; mo werɛ bɛho na moasu, nanso ewiasefoɔ ani bɛgye. Mobɛdi awerɛhoɔ nanso mo awerɛhoɔ no bɛdane anigyeɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɔbaa rebɛwo a, ne werɛ ho, ɛfiri sɛ, nʼamanehunuberɛ aduru so. Nanso, sɛ ɔnya wo a, ne werɛ firi ne yea, ɛfiri sɛ, nʼani gye sɛ wawo onipa aba ewiase.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/><char style="wj">Saa ara na ɛte wɔ mo ho. Seesei deɛ, mo werɛ aho. Nanso, mɛhunu mo bio ama mo ani agye na obi rentumi nnye saa anigyeɛ no mfiri mo nsam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/><char style="wj">Sɛ saa da no duru a, moremmisa me biribiara. Mereka nokorɛ akyerɛ mo, Agya no de biribiara a mode me din bɛbisa no bɛma mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/><char style="wj">Ɛbɛsi saa ɛberɛ yi, momfaa me din mmisaa biribiara da. Mommisa na wɔde bɛma mo na mo anigyeɛ awie pɛyɛ.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wiase So Nkonimdie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Menam abɛbuo mu na maka yeinom akyerɛ mo. Nanso, ɛberɛ bi bɛba a merenkasa abɛbuo mu bio, na mmom, mɛka biribiara a ɛfa Agya no ho no pefee akyerɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/><char style="wj">Sɛ saa da no duru a, mode me din bɛbisa no biribiara a ɛho hia mo. Menka sɛ me na mɛbisa Agya no ama mo,</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/><char style="wj">ɛfiri sɛ, Agya no ankasa dɔ mo. Ɔdɔ mo, ɛfiri sɛ, modɔ me na moagye adi sɛ mefiri Onyankopɔn nkyɛn na mebaeɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/><char style="wj">Mefiri Agya no nkyɛn na mebaa ewiase; na afei merefiri ewiase akɔ Agya no nkyɛn.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Nʼasuafoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Afei deɛ, wokasa pefee ma yɛte wo aseɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Yɛahunu sɛ wonim biribiara; ɛho nhia sɛ obi bisa wo nsɛm. Yei ama yɛagye adi sɛ wofiri Onyankopɔn nkyɛn.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ. <char style="wj">“Afei deɛ, mogye di?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/><char style="wj">Ɛberɛ bi rebɛduru, na mpo aduru dada a mo nyinaa bɛbɔ ahwete na obiara akɔ ne fie na aka me nko. Nanso, ɛrenka me nko ɛfiri sɛ, Agya no ka me ho.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Maka yeinom akyerɛ mo na moanya asomdwoeɛ wɔ me mu. Mobɛhunu amane wɔ ewiase. Nanso, monnyina pintinn! Madi ewiase so nkonim!”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Bɔ Mpaeɛ Ma Nʼasuafoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesu kaa saa nsɛm yi wieeɛ no, ɔhwɛɛ ɔsoro bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JHN 17:1">
    <char style="wj">“Agya, ɛberɛ no aduru. Hyɛ wo Ba no animuonyam, na Ɔba no nso nhyɛ wo animuonyam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/><char style="wj">Womaa no nnipa nyinaa so tumi sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔbɛma wɔn a wode wɔn maa no no nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/><char style="wj">Na ɛkwan a wɔnam so bɛnya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ ne sɛ, wɔbɛhunu Onyankopɔn korɔ nokwafoɔ no, ne Yesu Kristo a wosomaa no baa asase so no!</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/><char style="wj">Medaa wʼanimuonyam adi kyerɛeɛ wɔ asase so na mewiee adwuma a wode hyɛɛ me nsa no yɛ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/><char style="wj">Na afei, Agya, fa animuonyam a mewɔ wɔ wʼanim ansa na worebɔ ewiase no hyɛ me wɔ wʼanim ha.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mama nnipa a na anka wɔte ewiase a wode wɔn hyɛɛ me nsa no ahunu wo. Na wɔyɛ wo dea na wode wɔn maa me. Wɔatie wʼasɛm.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/><char style="wj">Afei, wɔahunu sɛ biribiara a wode maa me no firi wo nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/><char style="wj">Mekaa asɛm a woka kyerɛɛ me sɛ menka nkyerɛ wɔn no kyerɛɛ wɔn na wɔtieeɛ. Wɔnim sɛ ɛyɛ nokorɛ sɛ mefiri wo nkyɛn na mebaeɛ. Na wɔgye di sɛ wo na wosomaa me.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/><char style="wj">Mebɔ mpaeɛ ma wɔn. Memmɔ mpaeɛ mma wɔn a wɔnnye wʼasɛm nni, na mmom, nnipa a wode wɔn maa me no na mebɔ mpaeɛ ma wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔyɛ wo dea.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/><char style="wj">Biribiara a mewɔ no yɛ wo dea na biribiara a wowɔ no nso yɛ me dea. Ɛnam yeinom so ama manya animuonyam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/><char style="wj">Na afei, merefiri ewiase, na magya wɔn wɔ akyire aba wo nkyɛn. Agya kronkron, wɔn a wode wɔn maa me no, fa wo din a tumi wɔ mu no bɔ wɔn ho ban na wɔayɛ baako sɛdeɛ wo ne me yɛ baako no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/><char style="wj">Ɛberɛ a me ne wɔn wɔ hɔ no, mede tumi a wode maa me no hwɛɛ wɔn so. Mebɔɔ wɔn ho ban, na wɔn mu biara annyera, gye onipa a ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyera no nko ara, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, Atwerɛsɛm no bɛba mu.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei mereba wo nkyɛn. Maka saa nsɛm yi nyinaa ɛberɛ a meda so wɔ ewiase yi sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mʼanigyeɛ bɛhyɛ wɔn ma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/><char style="wj">Mekaa wʼasɛm kyerɛɛ wɔn na ewiasefoɔ tanee wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔmfiri ewiase sɛdeɛ me nso memfiri ewiase no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/><char style="wj">Memmisa wo sɛ yi wɔn firi ewiase, na mmom, mesrɛ sɛ, bɔ wɔn ho ban firi ɔbonsam nsam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/><char style="wj">Sɛdeɛ memfiri ewiase no, saa ara nso na wɔmfiri ewiase.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/><char style="wj">Fa wo nsɛm a ɛyɛ nokorɛ no kyerɛkyerɛ wɔn na ɛnte wɔn ho, na ɛnyɛ wɔn kronkron.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/><char style="wj">Sɛdeɛ wosomaa me baa ewiase no, saa ara na me nso meresoma wɔn akɔ ewiase.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/><char style="wj">Wɔn enti, mede me ho ma wo sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔn nso de wɔn ho nyinaa bɛma wo.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Memmɔ mpaeɛ mma wɔn nko. Mebɔ mpaeɛ ma wɔn a wɔnam asuafoɔ asɛm a wɔbɛka no so agye adi no nso.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/><char style="wj">Mebɔ mpaeɛ sɛ wɔn nyinaa bɛyɛ baako. Agya, sɛdeɛ wowɔ me mu na me nso mewɔ wo mu no, saa ara nso na ma wɔntena yɛn mu. Ma wɔn nyinaa nyɛ baako sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ewiase bɛgye adi sɛ, wo na wosomaa me.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/><char style="wj">Mede animuonyam a wode hyɛɛ me a ɛmaa me ne wo yɛɛ baako no ahyɛ wɔn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔn nso, wɔbɛyɛ baako sɛdeɛ yɛn nso yɛyɛ baako no.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/><char style="wj">Mewɔ wɔn mu na wo nso wowɔ me mu, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔn nyinaa bɛyɛ baako na ewiase ahunu sɛ, wo na wosomaa me na wodɔ wɔn sɛdeɛ wodɔ me no</char><verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Agya, mepɛ sɛ wɔn a wode wɔn maa me no bɛka me ho wɔ faako a mewɔ no, na wɔahunu mʼanimuonyam, animuonyam a wode maa me no, ɛfiri sɛ, wodɔ me ansa na wobɔɔ ewiase.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Agya kronkron, ewiase nnim wo, nanso me deɛ, menim wo; na asuafoɔ yi nim sɛ wo na wosomaa me.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/><char style="wj">Mama wɔahunu sɛdeɛ wo te na mɛkɔ so ayɛ saa daa, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔdɔ a wodɔ me no bɛtena wɔn nso mu na me nso, matena wɔn nso mu bi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkyere Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yesu bɔɔ saa mpaeɛ yi wieeɛ no, ɔne nʼasuafoɔ no firii baabi a wɔwɔ no kɔtwaa asuo Kidron kɔɔ turo bi mu.<verse eid="JHN 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Esiane sɛ na Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no taa kɔ hɔ no enti, na Yuda a ɔyii no maeɛ no nim hɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Farisifoɔ no somaa Yuda ne asraafoɔ ne asɔredan mu awɛmfoɔ a wɔkurakura akodeɛ ne nkanea kɔɔ faako a wɔwɔ no.<verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yesu a na ɔnim deɛ ɛbɛba ne so nyinaa no kɔhyiaa wɔn bisaa wɔn sɛ. <char style="wj">“Hwan na mohwehwɛ no?”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Yesu a ɔfiri Nasaret no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me ni!”</char> Na Yuda a ɔyii no maeɛ no gyina hɔ bi. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me ni”</char> no, wɔpinpinii wɔn akyi na wɔhwehwee ase.<verse eid="JHN 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Ɔsane bisaa wɔn bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Morehwehwɛ hwan?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Na wɔbuaa sɛ, “Yesu a ɔfiri Nasaret no.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Maka akyerɛ mo dada sɛ me ni. Sɛ me na morehwehwɛ me de a, ɛnneɛ momma mʼasuafoɔ no nkɔ.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Ɔkaa yei nyinaa sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a nsɛm a wɔaka sɛ, <char style="wj">“Agya, wɔn a wode wɔn maa me no mu baako koraa nyeraeɛ”</char> no, bɛba mu.<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, Petro a na ɔkura sekan no tweeɛ, de twaa ɔsɔfopanin no asomfoɔ no mu baako aso nifa. Saa akoa no din de Malko.<verse eid="JHN 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ Petro sɛ, <char style="wj">“Fa wo sekan no sane hyɛ faako a wotwe firiiɛ. Ɛnsɛ sɛ menom kuruwa a mʼAgya de ama me no ano anaa?”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Gyina Anas Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Asraafoɔ no ne wɔn panin ne asɔredan mu awɛmfoɔ no kyeree Yesu, kyekyeree ne nsa, <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>de no dii ɛkan kɔmaa Anas a na nʼase ne Kaiafa a saa ɛberɛ no na ɔyɛ Ɔsɔfopanin no. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Kaiafa na ɔtuu Yudafoɔ no fo sɛ, ɛyɛ sɛ onipa baako bɛwu ama ɔman no.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Pa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simon Petro ne osuani baako dii Yesu akyi. Na osuani baako no yɛ obi a ɔsɔfopanin no nim no yie. Saa osuani no na ɔnyaa ɛkwan kɔɔ ɔsɔfopanin no efie hɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Petro deɛ ɔkaa ɛpono no akyi. Saa osuani a na ɔnim ɔsɔfopanin no yie no, sane baeɛ ne abaayewa a na ɔhwɛ ɛpono no ano no bɛkasaeɛ maa Petro nyaa ɛkwan kɔɔ mu.<verse eid="JHN 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Abaayewa a ɔgyina ɛpono ano no bisaa Petro sɛ, “Wonyɛ saa onipa no asuafoɔ no mu baako anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Petro buaa sɛ, “Dabi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na ɛyɛ awɔberɛ, enti na asomfoɔ no ne asraafoɔ no asɔ ogya a wɔreto. Petro nso kɔgyinaa hɔ too ogya no bi.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsɔfopanin No Bisa Yesu Nsɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Ɔsɔfopanin no bisaa Yesu nsɛm faa nʼasuafoɔ no ne ne nkyerɛkyerɛ ho.<verse eid="JHN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mekaa me nsɛm nyinaa wɔ dwam na mekyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔ asɔredan ne hyiadan mu a nnipa nyinaa hyia hɔ no. Menkaa asɛm biara wɔ kɔkoam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/><char style="wj">Adɛn enti na wobisa saa asɛm yi? Bisa wɔn a wɔtiee me no. Wɔn na wɔnim asɛm a mekaeɛ.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesu kaa saa no, awɛmfoɔ no mu baako bɔɔ no sotorɔ kaa sɛ, “Wo sɛɛ ne hwan a wotumi kasa ɔsɔfopanin anim saa.”<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ maka asɛmmɔne bi a, ka asɛm a mekaeɛ no na obiara a ɔwɔ ha nte bi. Na sɛ asɛm a mekaeɛ no nso yɛ nokorɛ deɛ a, adɛn enti na wobɔ me?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Afei, Anas maa wɔde Yesu a wɔakyekyere ne nsa no kɔɔ Ɔsɔfopanin Kaiafa anim.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Pa Yesu Bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Ɛberɛ a Petro da so gyina hɔ reto ogya no bi no, wɔn a na wɔgyina hɔ no mu bi bisaa no sɛ, “Wo nso wonyɛ ɔbarima no asuafoɔ no mu baako anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Petro sanee bio sɛ, “Dabi, menka wɔn ho.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Ɔsɔfopanin no asomfoɔ no mu baako a na ɔyɛ deɛ Petro twaa nʼaso no busuani no bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ wo na na wo ne no wɔ turo no mu hɔ no?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Petro sane sanee bio sɛ, “Dabi.” Nʼano sii ara pɛ na akokɔ bɔneeɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔde Yesu Kɔ Pilato Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Wɔde Yesu firi Kaiafa fie de no kɔɔ Pilato ahemfie. Saa ɛberɛ no na ɛyɛ anɔpahema. Esiane sɛ na Yudafoɔ no mpɛ sɛ efi ka wɔn na wɔatumi adi Twam Afahyɛ aduane no bi enti, wɔankɔ hɔ bi. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Pilato firii adi baa faako a na nnipa no wɔ no bɛbisaa wɔn sɛ, “Bɔne bɛn na saa onipa yi ayɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Nnipa no buaa no sɛ, “Sɛ ɔnyɛɛ bɔne biara a anka yɛamfa no amma wʼanim ha.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilato ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mo ara momfa no nkɔ na momfa mo mmara so nni nʼasɛm.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Yudafoɔ no nso kaa sɛ, “Yɛnni tumi sɛ yɛkum obi.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Deɛ ɛsiiɛ yi maa nsɛm a Yesu ka de kyerɛɛ owu ko a ɔbɛwu no daa adi pefee.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilato sane kɔɔ nʼahemfie hɔ kɔbisaa Yesu sɛ, “Wone Yudafoɔ ɔhene no anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesu nso bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo ara wʼadwene na wode rebisa me saa asɛm yi, anaasɛ nnipa bi na aka me ho asɛm akyerɛ wo?”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilato buaa Yesu sɛ, “Wosusu sɛ meyɛ Yudani anaa? Wo ara wo nkurɔfoɔ ne wɔn asɔfoɔ mpanin na wɔde wo brɛɛ me. Ɛdeɛn na woayɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mʼahennie nnyɛ asase so ahennie; sɛ mʼahennie yɛ asase so ahennie a, anka mʼakyidifoɔ bɛko agye me afiri Yudafoɔ mpanimfoɔ no nsam. Mereka bio sɛ, mʼahennie nnyɛ asase so ahennie.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Pilato see no sɛ, “Ɛnneɛ na woyɛ ɔhene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo na woseɛ sɛ meyɛ ɔhene. Adeɛ baako pɛ enti na wɔwoo me baa ewiase ha, sɛ memmɛdi nokorɛ ho adanseɛ. Obiara a ɔpɛ nokorɛ no tie me.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilato bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn ne saa nokorɛ no?” Afei, Pilato firii adi kɔɔ Yudafoɔ no nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Menni asɛm biara a mɛgyina so abu no fɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Nanso, sɛdeɛ mo Twam Afahyɛ amanneɛ te no, afeɛ biara moma megyaa ɔdeduani baako ma mo. Mopɛ sɛ megyaa Yudafoɔ ɔhene no ma mo anaa?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Yudafoɔ no teateaam sɛ, “Dabi! Ɛnyɛ saa onipa yi. Gyaa Baraba ma yɛn!” Na saa Baraba yi yɛ ɔmammɔfoɔ.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Pilato ma wɔbɔɔ Yesu mmaa. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Asraafoɔ no de nkasɛɛ nwonoo ahenkyɛ de hyɛɛ Yesu; afei, wɔde atadeɛ kɔkɔɔ nso hyɛɛ no. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Wɔdii ne ho fɛw, bobɔɔ no asotorɔ, kaa sɛ, “Yudafoɔ ɔhene, wo nkwa so!”<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilato firii adi kɔka kyerɛɛ ɛdɔm no bio sɛ, “Mɛsane de no abrɛ mo ama moahunu sɛ menni asɛm biara a mɛgyina so abu no fɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu firii adi baeɛ no, na ɔhyɛ ahenkyɛ a wɔde nkasɛɛ anwono ne atadeɛ kɔkɔɔ. Pilato ka kyerɛɛ dɔm no sɛ, “Onipa no ni!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Ɛberɛ a asɔfoɔ mpanin ne awɛmfoɔ no hunuu Yesu no, wɔteateaam sɛ, “Bɔ no asɛnnua mu! Bɔ no asɛnnua mu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilato ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mo ara ankasa momfa no nkɔ nkɔbɔ no asɛnnua mu, ɛfiri sɛ, menni asɛm biara a mɛgyina so abu no fɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Yudafoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Yɛwɔ mmara a ɛkyerɛ sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔwu, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔkaa sɛ, ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn Ba.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Ɛberɛ a Pilato tee asɛm a wɔkaeɛ no, ɔbɔɔ hu yie. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Ɔsane kɔɔ ahemfie hɔ kɔbisaa Yesu sɛ, “Ɛhe na wofiri?” Nanso Yesu ammua no. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilato bisaa no sɛ, “Woremmua me anaa? Ɛsɛ sɛ wohunu sɛ, mewɔ tumi sɛ megyaa wo na mewɔ tumi nso sɛ mema wɔbɔ wo asɛnnua mu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ Onyankopɔn amfa saa tumi no amma wo a, anka wonni me so tumi biara. Enti onipa a ɔde me brɛɛ wo no na wayɛ bɔne a ɛso.”</char><verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Ɛberɛ a Pilato tee asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no, ɔhwehwɛɛ ɛkwan bi a ɔbɛfa so agyaa no. Nanso, Yudafoɔ no teateaam sɛ, “Sɛ wogyaa no a, na wonyɛ Kaesare adamfo! Obiara a ɔyɛ ne ho ɔhene no tia Kaesare!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Ɛberɛ a Pilato tee asɛm a Yudafoɔ no kaeɛ no, ɔde Yesu firii adi na ɔbɛtenaa nʼatemmuo adwa so wɔ faako a wɔfrɛ hɔ Aboɔ Nsɛmeeɛ, a Hebri kasa mu, ɛyɛ “Gabata.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Adeɛ rebɛkye ama Twam Afahyɛ no aduru so no, ɛbɛyɛ owigyinaeɛ no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Pilato ka kyerɛɛ Yudafoɔ no sɛ, “Mo ɔhene no ni!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Ɛdɔm no nso teateaa mu bio sɛ, “Fa no kɔ! Bɔ no asɛnnua mu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Mopɛ sɛ mebɔ mo ɔhene no asɛnnua mu anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Asɔfoɔ mpanin no kaa sɛ, “Yɛn ɔhene a yɛwɔ ara ne Kaesare!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Afei, Pilato de Yesu maa Yudafoɔ no sɛ wɔnkɔbɔ no asɛnnua mu.<verse eid="JHN 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Yesu Asɛnnua Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Enti, wɔde Yesu a nʼasɛnnua da ne kɔn ho no kɔɔ kuro no mfikyire baabi a wɔfrɛ hɔ “Nitire So” hɔ, a Hebri kasa mu ɛyɛ “Golgota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Ɛhɔ na wɔbɔɔ Yesu asɛnnua mu. Wɔbɔɔ nnipa baanu bi nso asɛnnua mu kaa ne ho. Na ɔbaako sɛn ne benkum so ɛnna ɔbaako nso sɛn ne nifa so a Yesu sɛn wɔn mfimfini.<verse eid="JHN 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilato twerɛɛ sɛ:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="JHN 19:19">Yesu Nasareni, Yudafoɔ Ɔhene</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:19">maa wɔde taree nʼasɛnnua no atifi. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Esiane sɛ faako a wɔbɔɔ Yesu asɛnnua mu ne kuro no mu ɛkwan nware, na bio wɔatwerɛ nsɛm no wɔ Hebri, Roma ne Hela kasa mu no enti, nnipa bebree hunu kenkaneeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Yudafoɔ asɔfoɔ mpanin no ka kyerɛɛ Pilato sɛ, “Ntwerɛ sɛ, ‘Yudafoɔ ɔhene’ na mmom twerɛ sɛ, ‘Saa ɔbarima yi na ɔkaa sɛ, mene Yudafoɔ ɔhene!’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilato kaa sɛ, “Deɛ matwerɛ no, matwerɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Asraafoɔ no bɔɔ Yesu asɛnnua mu wieeɛ no, wɔkyɛɛ ne ntadeɛ mu maa asraafoɔ ɛnan no. Na saa atadeɛ no yɛ atadeɛ bi a, wɔanwono firi ne ɔsoro kɔsi ne fam a ɛnni mpameeɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Asraafoɔ no nyinaa kaa sɛ, “Mommma yɛnntete mu. Momma yɛmmɔ so ntonto na yɛnhunu onipa a ɔbɛnya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Adeɛ a wɔyɛeɛ yi sii sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Atwerɛsɛm a ɛka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Wɔkyekyɛɛ me ntadeɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">bɔɔ so ntonto faeɛ” no bɛba mu.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Deɛ asraafoɔ no yɛeɛ ne no.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Nnipa a na wɔgyina Yesu asɛnnua no ho pɛɛ no ne ne maame, ne maame nuabaa, Maria, a ɔyɛ Kleopa yere ne Maria Magdalene. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yesu hunuu ne maame ne osuani a ɔdɔ no no sɛ wɔgyina hɔ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ ne maame sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔbaa, wo ba nie.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ osuani no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo maame nie.”</char> Ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no, osuani no faa no ne no kɔtenaeɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Wuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, Yesu hunuiɛ sɛ afei deɛ biribiara aba nʼawieeɛ, na sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Atwerɛsɛm no bɛba mu no enti, ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Osukɔm de me.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Wɔde sapɔ a ɛtua hisope ano bɔɔ nsã a emu keka mu de kaa nʼano. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesu nom wieeɛ no, ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mawie!”</char> Ɔkaa yei wieeɛ no, ɔsii ne ti ase na ɔgyaee ne honhom mu.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Na da no yɛ ahosiesie da, na Yudafoɔ mpanimfoɔ no mpɛ sɛ wɔma amu no sensɛn asɛnnua no so kɔsi nʼadekyeeɛ a wɔbɛdi Twam Afahyɛ no. Enti, wɔkɔka kyerɛɛ Pilato sɛ wɔpɛ sɛ wɔbubu nnipa no nan sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛtumi ayiyi wɔn amu no afiri asɛnnua no so. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Asraafoɔ no kɔbubuu ɔbarima a ɔdi ɛkan a ɔka nnipa baanu a wɔbɔɔ wɔne Yesu asɛnnua mu ho no nan; wɔwieeɛ no, wɔkɔbubuu ɔbarima a ɔtɔ so mmienu no nso nan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Wɔkɔbubuu ɔbarima a: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wɔyɛ yei, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a onipa a wɔabɔ no asɛnnua mu no bɛwu ntɛm.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Nanso wɔduruu Yesu so no, wɔhunuu sɛ ɔno deɛ, na wawu dada enti wɔammubu ne nan bi. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Asraafoɔ no mu baako de ne pea wɔɔ ne mfe maa mogyasufi firi ne mfe mu baeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Onipa a ɔhunuu deɛ ɛsiiɛ no na wadi ho adanseɛ. Nʼadanseɛ no yɛ nokorɛ, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mo nso mobɛgye adi. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Yeinom nyinaa sii sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, Atwerɛsɛm a ɛka sɛ, “Wɔremmu ne dompe bi” <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>ne “Nnipa bɛhwɛ deɛ wɔwɔɔ ne mfe mu pea” no bɛba mu.<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsie Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Yei akyi no, Yosef a ɔfiri Arimatea a ɛsiane Yudafoɔ ho hu enti, na ɔyɛ Yesu suani wɔ kɔkoam no kɔsrɛɛ Pilato sɛ ɔmma no ɛkwan na ɔnkɔyi Yesu amu no. Pilato penee nʼadesrɛ no so. Ɛno enti, ɔkɔyii Yesu amu no. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Nikodemo a da bi anadwo ɔkɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn no nso de kurobo ne aduhwam mfrafraeɛ a emu duru bɛyɛ kilogram aduasa mmiɛnsa baeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Wɔn baanu no de nwera ne aduhwam mfrafraeɛ no kyekyeree Yesu amu no sɛdeɛ Yudafoɔ ɛkwan a wɔfa so sie wɔn amu no teɛ no. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Na ɔboda foforɔ bi a wɔnsiee obi wɔ mu da wɔ turo bi a ɛbɛn baabi a wɔbɔɔ Yesu asɛnnua mu no. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Esiane sɛ na saa ɔboda no bɛn no enti, wɔsiee Yesu amu no wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Owusɔreɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Kwasiada anɔpahema, Maria Magdalene sɔre kɔɔ da no so kɔhunuu sɛ obi apire ɛboɔ no afiri ɔboda no ano. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Ɔhunuu saa no, ɔde ahoɔherɛ kɔɔ Simon Petro ne osuani a Yesu dɔ no no nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Nnipa bi akɔfa Awurade amu no afiri ɛda no mu na mennim faako a wɔde no akɔto!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Petro ne saa osuani yi tee asɛm no no, wɔtuu mmirika kɔɔ ɛda no so. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Nanso, saa osuani yi maa ne mmirika mu yɛɛ den twaa Petro ho kɔduruu hɔ kane. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Ɔduruu ɔboda no ano no, wanwura mu. Ɔbɔɔ ne mu ase hwɛɛ mu hunuu sɛ nwera a wɔde kyekyeree Yesu amu no gu hɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simon Petro deɛ, ɔbɛduruu hɔ no, ɔwuraa ɔboda no mu. Ɔhunuu nwera a wɔde kyekyeree Yesu amu no sɛ ɛgu hɔ, <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>a nwera a wɔde bɔɔ ne ti no nso gu baabi. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Afei, osuani a ɔduruu ɔboda no ho kane no nso wuraa mu hunuu saa nneɛma no maa ɔgye diiɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Saa ɛberɛ no nyinaa na asuafoɔ baanu yi nnya ntee deɛ Atwerɛsɛm aka afa Yesu wusɔreɛ ho no ase. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Afei, asuafoɔ no firii hɔ kɔɔ efie.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Ne Ho Adi Kyerɛ Maria Magdalene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Maria deɛ na ɔda so gyina ɔboda no ho resu. Ɔgu so resu no, ɔbɔɔ ne mu ase hwɛɛ ɔboda no mu, <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>na ɔhunuu ɔsoro abɔfoɔ baanu a wɔhyehyɛ ntadeɛ fitafitaa a ɔbaako te atifi na ɔbaako nso te anafoɔ wɔ faako a na Yesu amu no da no.<verse eid="JHN 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ɔbaa, adɛn na woresu sɛɛ yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Maria de awerɛhoɔ buaa sɛ, “Nnipa bi abɛfa mʼAwurade na mennim faako a wɔde no akɔto.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Afei, ɔtwaa nʼani hwɛɛ nʼakyi na ɔhunuu sɛ na obi gyina hɔ a ɛyɛ Yesu, nanso na ɔnnim sɛ ɛyɛ ɔno.<verse eid="JHN 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔbaa, adɛn enti na woresu sɛɛ yi? Hwan na worehwehwɛ no?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Na Maria deɛ ɔsusu sɛ ɛyɛ turom hɔ hwɛfoɔ enti, ɔbisaa no sɛ, “Owura, sɛ wo na wofaa no firii ha a, mesrɛ wo, kyerɛ me faako a wode no akɔto na menkɔfa no.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesu frɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Maria!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Maria twaa nʼani hwɛɛ no na ɔgyee so wɔ Hebri kasa mu sɛ, <char style="it">“Rabuni!”</char> (a aseɛ ne “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ”).<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsɔ me mu, ɛfiri sɛ, mennya nkɔɔ mʼAgya nkyɛn; kɔka kyerɛ mʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, meresane akɔ mʼAgya a ɔyɛ wɔn agya ne me Onyankopɔn a ɔyɛ wɔn nso Onyankopɔn no nkyɛn.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Maria Magdalene firii hɔ kɔbɔɔ asuafoɔ no amaneɛ sɛ wahunu Awurade na ɔkaa asɛm a Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no no kyerɛɛ wɔn.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Ne Ho Adi Kyerɛ Nʼasuafoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Saa ɛda no ara anwummerɛ a na ɛsiane Yudafoɔ mpanin no ho hu enti, asuafoɔ no ato wɔn ho ɛpono mu no, Yesu baa ɛdan no mu hɔ kyeaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Asomdwoeɛ nka mo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Ɔkyeaa wɔn wieeɛ no, ɔde ne nsam ne ne mfem kyerɛɛ wɔn. Asuafoɔ no hunuu Awurade no, wɔn ani gyee yie.<verse eid="JHN 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesu sane kyeaa wɔn bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Asomdwoeɛ nka mo.”</char> Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛdeɛ Agya no somaa me no, saa ara na me nso meresoma mo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Yei akyi, ɔhome guu wɔn so kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Honhom Kronkron no mmra mo so.</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mode obi bɔne kyɛ no a, wɔde bɛkyɛ no; na sɛ moamfa obi bɔne ankyɛ no a, wɔremfa nkyɛ no.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Ne Ho Adi Kyerɛ Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ asuafoɔ no, na Toma a wɔfrɛ no Ata a ɔyɛ asuafoɔ dumienu no mu baako no nni hɔ bi. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Ɛberɛ a asuafoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wɔahunu Awurade no!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Wannye anni kaa sɛ, “Sɛ manhunu ne nsam ne ne mfem twa no na mamfa me nsa anka a, merennye nni da.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Nnawɔtwe akyi, asuafoɔ no sane hyiaeɛ bio a na Toma ka wɔn ho. Ɛwom sɛ na wɔatoto apono no mu deɛ, nanso Yesu sane baa hɔ kyeaa wɔn bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Asomdwoeɛ nka mo!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Afei, Yesu frɛɛ Toma ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Fa wo nsa bɛka me nsam ne me mfem. Nnye akyinnyeɛ bio. Gye di!”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Toma de ahonuo kaa sɛ, “Wo ne mʼAwurade ne me Onyankopɔn!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Woahunu me no enti, na woagye adi; nhyira nka wɔn a wɔnhunuu me nanso wɔgye me di.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesu yɛɛ anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ bebree kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no a wɔantwerɛ wɔ saa nwoma yi mu. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Nanso, biribiara a wɔatwerɛ wɔ saa nwoma yi mu no, wɔatwerɛ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mobɛgye adi sɛ, Yesu ne Agyenkwa, ne Onyankopɔn Ba no; na sɛ mogye no di a, mobɛnya nkwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Ne Ho Adi Bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Akyire no, Yesu yii ne ho adi bio wɔ Tiberia Po ho kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no mu bi. Ɛkwan a ɔfaa so yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn no nie: <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na Simon Petro, ne Toma (a wɔfrɛ no Ata), ne Natanael a ɔfiri Kana a ɛwɔ Galilea ne Sebedeo mma ne Yesu asuafoɔ no mu baanu na na wɔwɔ ɔtadeɛ no ho. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Wɔwɔ hɔ no, Petro ka kyerɛɛ wɔn a wɔaka no sɛ, “Merekɔyi nam.” Wɔn a na wɔka ne ho no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yɛne wo bɛkɔ.” Wɔn nyinaa kɔtenaa kodoɔ mu kɔɔ ɛpo, nanso saa anadwo no wɔanyi nam biara.<verse eid="JHN 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Adeɛ kyee anɔpa a anim retete no, Yesu bɛgyinaa mpoano hɔ, nanso na asuafoɔ no nnim sɛ ɛyɛ ɔno.<verse eid="JHN 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Ɔfrɛɛ asuafoɔ no bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Anuanom, moayi nam bi anaa?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Dabi.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mongu mo asau no wɔ nifa fam na mobɛyi nam.”</char> Wɔguu asau no sɛdeɛ ɔkaeɛ no. Nam yɛɛ asau no ma sei tɔ a na wɔtwe a ɛntwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Afei, osuani a Yesu dɔ no no ka kyerɛɛ Petro sɛ, “Ɛyɛ Awurade.” Ɛberɛ a Simon Petro tee sɛ ɛyɛ Awurade no, ɔhyɛɛ nʼatadeɛ, huri tɔɔ nsuo no mu dware kɔɔ mpoano hɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Asuafoɔ a wɔaka no tenaa kodoɔ no mu baa mpoano hɔ bi. Wɔreba no, na wɔretwe asau a na nam ahyɛ no ma sei tɔ no. Ɛkwan a ɛfiri faako a wɔwɔ wɔ ɛpo no so ba mpoano hɔ no bɛyɛ mita ɔha. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Wɔduruu mpoano hɔ no wɔhunuu sɛ obi asɔ ogya retoto nam na burodo bi nso gu nkyɛn.<verse eid="JHN 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momfa nam a moayi no bi mmra.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simon Petro foro kɔɔ kodoɔ no mu kɔtwee asau a na nam akɛseɛ bɛyɛ ɔha aduonum mmiɛnsa wɔ mu no baa mpoano hɔ. Ɛwom sɛ na nam ayɛ asau no ma deɛ, nanso antete. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesu frɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mommɛdidi.”</char> Asuafoɔ no mu biara ammisa no onipa ko a ɔyɛ ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔnim sɛ ɛyɛ Awurade. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yesu faa burodo no kyekyɛ maa wɔn. Yei akyi no, ɔkyɛɛ nam a na wɔatoto no nso maa wɔn. <verse eid="JHN 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Yei ne ne mprɛnsa so a Yesu sɔre firii awufoɔ mu no, ɔyii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Kyerɛ Ne Dɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Wɔdidi wieeɛ no, Yesu bisaa Simon Petro sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yohane ba Simon, wodɔ me sene sɛdeɛ yeinom dɔ me no anaa?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Petro buaa sɛ, “Aane, Awurade, wonim sɛ medɔ wo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yɛne me nnwammaa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Yesu sane bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yohane ba Simon, wodɔ me anaa?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Petro sane buaa sɛ, “Aane, Awurade, wonim sɛ medɔ wo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu sane ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Hwɛ me nnwan.”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Yesu bisaa no ne mprɛnsa so sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yohane ba Simon, ampa ara sɛ wodɔ me?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Asɛm yi yɛɛ Petro awerɛhoɔ sɛ Yesu abisa no saa asɛm korɔ no ara mprɛnsa. Enti, ɔka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, wonim biribiara, na wonim nso sɛ, medɔ wo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yɛne me nnwan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/><char style="wj">Meka nokorɛ akyerɛ wo. Woyɛ aberanteɛ no, na wotumi siesie wo ho kɔ baabiara a wopɛ, na woyɛ deɛ wopɛ biara nso. Nanso, sɛ wobɔ akɔkoraa a, wobɛtene wo nsam na obi asiesie wo ho ama wo, de wo akɔ baabi a anka wompɛ sɛ wokɔ.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no, ɔde kyerɛɛ owu ko a Petro bɛwu de ahyɛ Onyankopɔn animuonyam. Yesu ka kyerɛɛ Petro sɛ, <char style="wj">“Di mʼakyi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Petro twaa nʼani hwɛɛ nʼakyi hunuu sɛ osuani a Yesu dɔ no no di wɔn akyi. Saa osuani yi ne obi a wɔredidi no, ɔtwe bɛn Yesu bisaa no sɛ, “Awurade, hwan na ɔbɛyi wo ama” no? <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Petro hunuu saa osuani yi no, ɔbisaa Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, na yei nso ɛdeɛn na ɛbɛto no?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ mepɛ sɛ ɔtena hɔ kɔsi sɛ mɛsane aba a, ɛfa wo ho bɛn? Wo deɛ, di mʼakyi.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Asɛm a Yesu ka faa saa osuani yi ho no maa Yesu akyidifoɔ no mu pii susuu sɛ, saa osuani no renwu da. Nanso, na ɛnyɛ deɛ Yesu hwehwɛ akyerɛ ne no, ɛberɛ a ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ mepɛ sɛ ɔtena hɔ kɔsi sɛ mɛsane aba a, ɛfa wo ho bɛn?”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Saa osuani yi ne onipa a ɔdi yeinom nyinaa ho adanseɛ na ɔtwerɛeɛ nso. Yɛnim sɛ nʼadanseɛ no yɛ nokorɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Nneɛma bebree wɔ hɔ nso a Yesu yɛeɛ a wɔantwerɛ, na sɛ wɔtwerɛeɛ no mmaako mmaako a, anka megye di sɛ ɛrensene ewiase.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
